{"time": 1765557133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289227918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*回房狠狠地锁好门，把旧的那柄长刀斜靠在门板上，门被推开就会滑落，这才能安心坐在床上“……那个人，到底想干什么”"}
{"time": 1765557221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699640285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不如想想这个人是谁)"}
