{"time": 1765565867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297766546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也正中红心"}
{"time": 1765565964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213178891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手指灵巧地转着飞镖，\"为什么再来一次?\"感觉再试下去会出事，\"一次的结果不就够了?\"靠着梅梅，慵懒地露出自己的脖颈"}
{"time": 1765566029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382416552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪有玩一次就跑的...”"}
{"time": 1765566080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279774376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1213178891][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 妹妹伸出胳膊，环绕脖子抱着你"}
