{"time": 1765722073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673922269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肯定啊）"}
{"time": 1765722553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136756356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 怎么不进麦"}
{"time": 1765722572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140522938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在晾衣服）"}
{"time": 1765729777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683803316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1765729786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474790909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（等下）"}
{"time": 1765730176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610117159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1616005140][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不玩了，不玩了....我要睡觉了”西姆莉倒头就睡"}
{"time": 1765730207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785687000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=289227918]自然是没有人回应你，夜已经很深了"}
{"time": 1765730219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245379055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "睡！"}
{"time": 1765730383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632357295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=610117159]\"无聊诶。\"靠着梅梅坐下，对着她的耳边小声开口，\"是不是遇到太多怪人了？搞得我都有点神经质了。\""}
{"time": 1765730457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52210283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡不要当心，遇到危险我会保护你的”梅梅拍拍胸膛"}
{"time": 1765730594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091006845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52210283]\"什么嘛，不是我保护梅梅?\"打个哈欠，\"只是...今天遇到的人，好奇怪。\"皱了皱眉，\"反正...按水这件事...\""}
{"time": 1765730639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416253436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡想要报复回来吗”"}
{"time": 1765730737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321418433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"迟早有一天。\"摸摸她的脑袋，\"之后再说吧。\""}
{"time": 1765730771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316048853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯......”忍不住打了个哈欠“小卡，我也有点困了，想睡.....”"}
{"time": 1765730905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605925368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梅梅也睡吧。\"等着她睡下"}
{"time": 1765730962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012554616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡也..早点睡....”梅梅也倒头就睡"}
{"time": 1765731046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853902944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "本来打算出去转转，想了想最后还是作罢，在梅梅身边躺下睡觉"}
{"time": 1765731138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398692217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们很快都彻底陷入了沉睡"}
{"time": 1765731157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702437173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这一觉就直接睡到了第二天中午"}
{"time": 1765731167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011419892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你听到了一阵敲门声"}
{"time": 1765731168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810544890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好睡）"}
{"time": 1765731241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384871622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谁啊，大清……中午的，好吧”*从床上爬起来，凑到门口“谁？”"}
{"time": 1765731383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137268151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....格蕾西亚，你不会还在睡吧”是西姆莉的声音"}
{"time": 1765731489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111623811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么，很奇怪吗，昨晚睡得不踏实”*摇摇头“有新活了？”"}
{"time": 1765731533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137400903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...你倒是猜的没错，走吧去灰屋啦”"}
{"time": 1765731545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614726422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉拍了拍你的肩膀"}
{"time": 1765731581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740407039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行”跨上新剑，这就出门"}
{"time": 1765731759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346227339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一路无话，很快就来到了灰屋，客厅里，梅梅和卡缇西亚似乎还在睡"}
{"time": 1765731773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106033300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你去把她两叫醒吧”"}
{"time": 1765731854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750988229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这次也有他们两个的事？”叹了口气，走到卡提希亚跟前蹲下，端详一番"}
{"time": 1765731936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530806577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“肯定啊...都说了短时间内，会一直和她们行动的”"}
{"time": 1765731950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814649080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你看看我的面部描写)"}
{"time": 1765732064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016259620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎……你看着不会觉得很诡异吗？我看着都有点害怕了”摇摇头"}
{"time": 1765732102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898921680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "卡缇西亚的面貌实实在在的与你有几分相似，除此之外，她肯定更显稚嫩一些，此刻她的表情十分平静甚至乖巧，完全看不出来她是个喜欢杀人的家伙"}
{"time": 1765732129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201089008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实和你还是有点不一样的吧..习惯就好了，好了，快点把她叫醒吧”西姆莉催促道"}
{"time": 1765732299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108208333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "想了想，还是决定，先叫梅丹佐。“醒醒，中午了。有新工作了。不想做就再说”"}
{"time": 1765732410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211573346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔唔唔...什么...新工作”梅梅被你摇醒，但看起来还是昏昏沉沉的“小卡去..我就去..”然后扭头看向卡缇希亚，结果发现她还没醒...轻轻摇了摇“小卡..起床啦...太阳晒屁股了”边说边打了个哈欠"}
{"time": 1765732603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121423452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"揉揉眼睛，\"嗯...\"没怎么清醒过来，\"好困...\""}
{"time": 1765732623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214256884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小格有事找你...”"}
{"time": 1765732845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816164822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"找我?\"手掌盖住眼睛，拂起了一些前额的碎发，\"不知道...没看见。\""}
{"time": 1765732883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890889747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有新工作，做不做？还是说你已经有钱到不用赚钱了？”"}
{"time": 1765732992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951796190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你好烦啊...\"咂咂嘴，\"什么事?\"思绪逐渐回复"}
{"time": 1765733023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844077110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在去二楼找拉泽拉戈大人就好了”"}
{"time": 1765733044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526239462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“问她，此外你要是觉得不缺钱，可以现在和我说，以后我也不叫了”"}
{"time": 1765733232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260984715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有点不爽，坐起身揉碎头发，深呼吸了一下，看向格雷西亚，语气有些不耐烦，\"你为什么还在这站着?\""}
{"time": 1765733319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693699046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”懒得说更多，走了"}
{"time": 1765733337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549688610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "站到西姆莉旁边，准备上楼"}
{"time": 1765733484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954690079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身拍拍梅梅的脑袋，\"梅梅的态度怎么那么好?对待那种家伙就应该恶劣一点。\"收拾一下自己的匕首，打个哈欠再出门跟着上楼"}
{"time": 1765733533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117721690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是看到她的脸...我生不出说坏话的心...”戳手指自责在后面跟着你"}
{"time": 1765733718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385501384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手扯扯她的脸，\"那家伙又不是我，该骂就骂，该说就说。\"边说边点头，\"明白了吗?\""}
{"time": 1765733761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187230872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些迟疑 最后还是点了点头“我会努力的....”"}
{"time": 1765733937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419749835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上楼，当然不会再说什么。"}
{"time": 1765733998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016380494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们又来到了昨天的那个房间，摆设配置和昨天也基本一样，除了桌子上多了一个黑色的盒子"}
{"time": 1765734049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084464960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“人齐了，那我开始讲新的工作内容了”拉泽拉戈清了清嗓子"}
{"time": 1765734176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656026502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“鑒於鎮子上住了很多退伍老兵，所以在長野鎮有一個艾奧梅黛教堂並不稀奇。但是如果教堂的女祭司蒂利維亞·阿拉瑪肆意妄為的話，可能這個教堂就留不了幾天了。”\n拉澤拉戈的身影緊握住雙手「帝國中的叛亂正在愈演愈烈，並不僅限於佩紮克鎮和地獄灣沿岸。很多艾奧梅黛的信徒開始越來越大膽的談論君主製的利弊和公民權利。他們可能以為這裡是安多安了，老百姓只要一伸手就能奪取權利。但是他們錯了，這裡是切利亞斯不是安多安，而我們知道真正的力量在哪裡。」\n        「今天下午五階劍騎士阿拉瑪召集了所有人在教會前聽取佈道——就在短短的兩個小時之後。我不知道她想幹什麼，但是我覺得革命的噱頭可能只會在長野鎮的居民心中撒下困惑和沮喪的種子。這與我的願望正好相反。所以我希望你們能去參加這次集會。盒子裡面是一些帶有大男爵費克斯徽記的綬帶。你們都穿上，提醒人們這座城鎮的主人並非沒有支持者，看看事情會怎樣發展。在那之後，西姆莉會向我報告情況。至於報酬，就昨天晚上那樣的酬勞再加一倍。」"}
{"time": 1765734274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867203968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只需要戴着这些东西去转一圈就行了?\"语气有些漫不经心"}
