{"time": 1765770635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352307307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“直接去广场？”西姆莉询问道"}
{"time": 1765770673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871369047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不买东西的话，先去看看也无妨”"}
{"time": 1765770683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089283955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我无所谓，反正也没什么好准备的。\"皱了皱眉，\"或许该去买新衣服了。\""}
{"time": 1765770712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911657782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己的衣服，梅梅的衣服都有些时日没换过新的。"}
{"time": 1765770732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689988580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你可以去吉尔德杂货铺”没回头，但是接一嘴"}
{"time": 1765770851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448545958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“买衣服等任务结束了吧....我们总得事前做点准备踩踩点之类的”"}
{"time": 1765770887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887661908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行吧。\"踩在两人后面"}
{"time": 1765770938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535238099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=471480062]（你可以问她）"}
{"time": 1765771010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324016678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来，西姆莉。你昨天用到的卷轴是从哪里买的？”"}
{"time": 1765771069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711894381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，你想买卷轴？秘密哦，不过你可以告诉我你想要哪些卷轴，我帮你买”"}
{"time": 1765771092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836846439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我好善良”西姆莉忍不住感叹道"}
{"time": 1765771162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066373345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“隐匿阵营，还有重压之刃吧。虽然我是什么德行已经人尽皆知了”"}
{"time": 1765771180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062119533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“数量呢”"}
{"time": 1765771184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680310585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（快进到hail hydra）"}
{"time": 1765771243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255380698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“3：3吧”给她200金币“就算是无良商人应该也够了”"}
{"time": 1765771288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308119061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“够了够了，这些肯定够了”她喜笑颜开的收过了金币"}
{"time": 1765771295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605390515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"切，亏你还有自知之明。像你这种人，身上散发的味道已经够大了。卷轴可藏不住你。\"出言讥讽，抱着手臂扭头看向另一边。"}
{"time": 1765771302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899653573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大概明天吧...我就可以交给你”"}
{"time": 1765771497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976756518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们一路上走走聊聊，很快就到了广场，長野鎮的艾奧梅黛教堂被一圈鐵藝柵欄圍繞，坐落在一個城鎮廣場的北側，這個廣場的名字非常的貼切，就叫「教堂廣場」。廣場裡有一口井，還立有一塊木製告示牌用來張貼各種通知和聲明。店鋪圍繞在廣場四周，一條寬闊的大道穿過廣場貫通南北。教堂前擺著一張顯眼的白布桌子，明顯是為佈道做好了準備，不過此刻桌子上目前沒有任何東西。"}
{"time": 1765771590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028082983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=899653573]“行，那我就等着了……还有，没有自知之明的人才不配说这种话”"}
{"time": 1765771646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958421034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等会布道了我们再把那个戴上吧，现在先四处调查一下？”"}
{"time": 1765771738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133427676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，从哪看起呢？”在想要不要坐到布道桌前玩玩"}
{"time": 1765771758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658479147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"随你们。\"满不在乎，\"我又不在乎，也没有隐藏的必要。\""}
{"time": 1765771778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432759301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(倘若有人侦查邪恶，那我身上灵光不是大的吓人)"}
{"time": 1765771824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824733549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无所谓吧，这城里一半人都有）"}
{"time": 1765771892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475148373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当你们到达广场的时候，看到一小群當地老人和附近企業的工人正聚集在廣場上，大部分都圍繞在水井或著教堂院落的柵欄旁邊，嘰嘰喳喳地討論著他們聽到或想像中阿拉瑪要宣佈的事情"}
{"time": 1765771916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370476613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（察觉？）"}
{"time": 1765771917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418389527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么说，先去偷听他们在讲些什么，还是先去调查一下周边，看看有没有什么有用的东西”"}
{"time": 1765771949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596807967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉提出建议"}
{"time": 1765771989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556332504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"偷听?有这个必要?反正她们不认识我。\"说完，挤出自己认为还算标准和善的笑容，就准备走上去加入谈话，"}
{"time": 1765771992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023414675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想，要不直接进教堂（）"}
{"time": 1765772001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184767619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（邪恶人进教堂会被打死吗）"}
{"time": 1765772034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256873958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=556332504]（过交涉）"}
