{"time": 1765773631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939851880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那下午吧）"}
{"time": 1765773652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458738835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看我的20交涉)"}
{"time": 1765773706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420954648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？”大家都看到了加入的你“格蕾西亚？不对，又不太像，你是她亲戚？”"}
{"time": 1765773807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73745759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"亲戚?不认识，格雷西亚是谁?\"挂着得体的浅笑，拿住自己很久之前曾有过的贵族家教，\"日安，我是听闻布道一事从附近慕名而来。\""}
{"time": 1765773945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151825646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊...刚刚眼花了，还以为你是格蕾西亚那个混蛋...”然后他们又开始你一言，我一语的聊了起来"}
{"time": 1765773953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687448412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们听说了吗...”"}
{"time": 1765774003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029481747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（奔狼领有个奇怪的家伙在游荡）"}
{"time": 1765774136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059323661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "「我聽劍騎士阿拉瑪的一個兒子說，一位天使降臨在她面前！這意味教堂和鎮子要發生大事了！」"}
{"time": 1765774147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974538662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天使？真的假的，你这消息真的靠谱吗”"}
{"time": 1765774174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010348248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“靠谱的靠谱的，如果是假的，格蕾西亚明天出门就被马车撞死”"}
{"time": 1765774183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730418184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我反倒希望是假的了”"}
{"time": 1765774371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107120151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(圣教军?)"}
{"time": 1765774393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891359603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（圣教军是？他们不是在打恶魔么）"}
{"time": 1765774418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340307253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在一旁饶有兴趣地听着，遵循适当的礼仪，没有开口打断谈话，不过嘴角勾起的笑意此刻倒是发自真心。"}
{"time": 1765774440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522073187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=891359603](其实是感觉有点像，指挥官也看见天使了)"}
{"time": 1765774460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608404435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他们也要走天使道途了？）"}
{"time": 1765774479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285174781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（审判之矢把你们全射死）"}
{"time": 1765774482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793068314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=340307253]等她们谈完一阵才开口，\"艾奥梅黛在上，天使应该不会轻易下界吧？\""}
{"time": 1765774531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212143580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道啊，等会看看布道怎么说吧，費克斯可不喜歡這樣大規模的集會活\n動。阿拉瑪想要說的一定非常重要，否則她才不會冒激怒大男爵的風險。我猜大概率应该就跟那个天使有关”"}
{"time": 1765774679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158886362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，但是我怀疑，待会会有男爵的家伙过来。\"适当皱起眉，\"那些家伙来了该怎么处理？尤其是，那个谁谁，格雷西亚，活该被撞死的。\""}
{"time": 1765774889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509776735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道啊...到时候再说吧”"}
{"time": 1765774920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676721333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是听说阿拉玛举办这场集会还有别的原因哦”"}
{"time": 1765774934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664923293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么什么，还有什么内幕吗”周围人忍不住好奇起来"}
{"time": 1765775013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194973384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"摆出侧耳恭听的态度，微微低着脑袋"}
{"time": 1765775294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429355493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那人声音顾作阴沉“昨天晚上羅斯里克製革廠出事了。我打賭這一定就是激怒女祭司的原因。我們肯定會面對她帶來的地獄之火！”"}
{"time": 1765775409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51213752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(女祭司哪位)"}
{"time": 1765775419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860714654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"女祭司?\"蹙眉，\"那是谁?\""}
{"time": 1765775424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046955762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(就是阿拉玛)"}
{"time": 1765775445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073979046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（女祭司，剑骑士）"}
{"time": 1765775458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160098803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她不是艾奥梅黛的人吗)"}
{"time": 1765775460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022300646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1656026502]（这里也说了）"}
{"time": 1765775462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274851970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么会有地狱之火)"}
{"time": 1765775471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61764726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（比喻啊）"}
{"time": 1765775483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322623147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（形容很生气吧）"}
{"time": 1765775491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183226869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道还能说天堂之火？）"}
