{"time": 1765786808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048005861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"随你们。\"给梅梅也扣上面具，耸耸肩发表意见。"}
{"time": 1765786840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190844284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能不能先把面具卸了，这也太引人瞩目了吧....”西姆莉忍不住吐槽道"}
{"time": 1765786860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122610154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "周围的人有些也向你投来了奇怪的目光"}
{"time": 1765786867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308016922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样干什么都不方便吧”"}
{"time": 1765786956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665377151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你说的虽然有些道理。\"没有摘下来的意思，\"但是很遗憾和这家伙。\"指着格雷西亚，\"有点像，我怕待会有人驾着马车撞我。\""}
{"time": 1765787111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849339297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我都不怕，你怕什么”翻个白眼“你要是不想来，就去那个楼上放哨”指指那个二楼窗口"}
{"time": 1765787285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343217563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不想当你的替死鬼。\"没有挪步离开的意思，往那个货车走。"}
{"time": 1765787332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486353539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "货车前面有一只骡子，慵懒的在那晒在太阳"}
{"time": 1765787392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959576722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我有驯兽）"}
{"time": 1765787398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598716595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是好像）"}
{"time": 1765787531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599594917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(驯兽干嘛？)"}
{"time": 1765787542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479722289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "走过去稍微安抚一下那头驴，以便后续对货车探查的时候它不要乱叫"}
{"time": 1765787584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510969385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看看你的驯兽）"}
{"time": 1765787595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979515053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+7"}
{"time": 1765787595, "type": "reply", "message_id": "979515053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[芭芙娜]演奏出: 1D20+7={16}+7=23"}
{"time": 1765787648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652747821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "驴看你蛮顺眼的，没有乱叫"}
{"time": 1765787721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285302132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "去货车后面看看"}
{"time": 1765787724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945470869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（货车是哪种，有锁吗？）"}
{"time": 1765787764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069205138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是没顶的那种）"}
{"time": 1765787773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17991355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那种木制的吧)"}
{"time": 1765787794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990099968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦）"}
{"time": 1765787800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199822611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（三轮车（））"}
{"time": 1765787850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231531448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=682BCC19F337D81D35F0B0C7404E1D47.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQRJjTg4Wg_onDf_jj5ii2La3OEhhjTQyD_CijTzJismL-RAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhB9DwBNLcBxjsK4w00E8usvegI0RYIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMN09wiJeUEpgtr983dy3tb7VAWL8DbCjUDBEai47CtLL1K2CSHhmPBvPegUFFiRbzg,file_size=8659]"}
{"time": 1765787868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130859299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也没块布盖着？）"}
{"time": 1765787908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620179132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1285302132][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你看到了几个木桶，里面似乎装着什么液体"}
{"time": 1765787932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085797861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（知识本地或者知识自然）"}
{"time": 1765787933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539973347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看旁边有没有其他人，凑近一点闻闻味道"}
{"time": 1765787941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470928034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20+6"}
{"time": 1765787941, "type": "reply", "message_id": "470928034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20+6={8}+6=14"}
{"time": 1765787946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757997338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=539973347][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 闻起来有些刺鼻"}
{"time": 1765787952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284239127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。r2#d20+6"}
{"time": 1765787952, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1284239127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20+6= \n{12}+6=18\n{17}+6=23"}
{"time": 1765787956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926342343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这是梅梅的)"}
{"time": 1765787959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756009271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1936109981][CQ:at,qq=2875548981] 那你闻出来了"}
{"time": 1765787969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130355813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这是木焦油，而且很易燃"}
{"time": 1765788003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000070572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嚯，地狱之火”"}
{"time": 1765788054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935733146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"皱了皱眉，心里盘算着点燃它的事情，暂且压下，语气里有些兴奋，\"待会会用到的神秘道具?\""}
{"time": 1765788060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513582289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真不走心，不管是谁打算干什么，停在这里都不太聪明”摇头"}
{"time": 1765788209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476323726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯.....感觉确实好像确实可以用上”"}
{"time": 1765788210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923932105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看还有没有值得注意的"}
{"time": 1765788220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655148245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "货车上没有其他东西了"}
{"time": 1765788302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679496125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"待会再说好了。\"摆摆手，\"反正，盯紧这边，不管她要做什么。\""}
{"time": 1765788351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955582451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么你们真打算用一用？”皱了皱眉“我们只是来传递信号的，做过火了，适得其反”"}
{"time": 1765788481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868502093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先想想么，如果对方做的太过火了，我觉得我们做点什么也行吧”"}
{"time": 1765788489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711259035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"放都放在这了？\"一只手捂着脸颊，\"为什么不用一用?\"看着格雷西亚露齿笑。"}
{"time": 1765788666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860402742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“长野镇也不是特鲁恩一家独大，这个节骨点上落人口实，是嫌那群伪善者的盟友不够多？”刀鞘在地面点点，发出金属敲击声"}
{"time": 1765788744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955360506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们要做的话...做的隐秘一点就好了，所以如果小卡想用它做什么的话，计划需要严密一些”"}
{"time": 1765788979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422474515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...还需要什么严密的计划吗？\"耸耸肩，\"只是想放个烟花。\""}
{"time": 1765789037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360086278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随便你，放的时候把徽章摘下来就行”"}
{"time": 1765789106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“单纯的爆炸感觉一般啊，如果再配合一场炸裂的演讲，会不会效果更好一些”"}
{"time": 1765789198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690072322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯～你倒是有点子，你来?\""}
{"time": 1765789220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478029781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得格蕾西亚来更好，毕竟好多人都怕她”"}
{"time": 1765789311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884906463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她?我担心她的口才会起到反效果。\"吐了吐舌头，\"毕竟你看这家伙说话就一副死人样。\""}
{"time": 1765789334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616233203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之我是这样想的，你们还有其他想法吗，畅所欲言我说”"}
{"time": 1765789342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515270149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我很久没在很多人前说过话了。算了，随你的便，别弄出太多人民”"}
{"time": 1765789345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745209191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（命）"}
{"time": 1765789376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829173760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么可能会闹出人命呢....只要一声响就好了吧...”"}
{"time": 1765789387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361768031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，你们来决定吧”"}
{"time": 1765789411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676238347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道不是奔着闹出人命去吗？\"歪歪脑袋"}
{"time": 1765789458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544400523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "正当你们在讨论着这些的时候，身边忽然来了几个人"}
{"time": 1765789689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605625504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上嘴。"}
{"time": 1765789717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157543552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看看都是些什么人"}
{"time": 1765789779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581570687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从服装可以看出来似乎是治安官和警员，为首的人看到你们说到“西姆莉！我最愛的姪女，你在這裡做什麼？”"}
{"time": 1765789835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946995240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧....”西姆莉感觉心情忽然变得很差的样子“游手好闲罢了，姑姑”"}
{"time": 1765789885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773323160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“聽說你最近跟一些怪人混在一起。不向我介紹一下你的朋友嗎？”被称为罗娜的治安官看向你们说道"}
