{"time": 1765791101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536956299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西姆莉..昨晚皮革厂的事情你有听说， 你会不会恰好知道些什么”治安官又把头扭向西姆莉"}
{"time": 1765791104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600824982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然，只是遇见了，顺便问一问这件事。\"仪态端庄，故意透露出自己的身份。"}
{"time": 1765791120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501361313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我只有威吓）"}
{"time": 1765791128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858589919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“當然不知道，我該知道什麼嗎？”西姆莉反问道"}
