{"time": 1765791263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58720906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={96AF9AB7-723F-5424-4329-4F528231C5BD}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-96AF9AB7723F542443294F528231C5BD/0,file_size=1880]"}
{"time": 1765791287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270200972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你最好真的不知道....今天那祭祀的演讲说不定已经会让这场景够混乱的了.....不管你们认识也好不认识也罢，希望不要再给我添更多的乱了”她扶着额头离开"}
{"time": 1765791335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961524654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"啧....\"西姆莉撇了撇嘴“抱歉...我刚刚好像搞砸了一些事情”"}
{"time": 1765791381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701438215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和我无关，而且。\"停顿了一下，\"我早就习惯了，不用专门强调。\""}
{"time": 1765791410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163581557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不...肯定有关系的，不信你们四处看看”"}
{"time": 1765791414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448042538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有道歉的必要”摆摆手“而且她到底哪一边的？”"}
