{"time": 1765791454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994733320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1176793731][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你发现离你不远处有几个警员在观望着你们的动作"}
{"time": 1765791470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376325016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至少爆炸什么的，大概率做不了了”"}
{"time": 1765791510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137520902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我看未必……点的人未必是我们对不对”"}
{"time": 1765791514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825960286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1448042538]“...难说...硬说的话，可能是法律那边吧”"}
{"time": 1765791520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569244831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不会这个桶真的是，无主的吧）"}
{"time": 1765791535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593269818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总该是谁停在这的）"}
{"time": 1765791547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280198683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1569244831]（是心不在焉的工人，停在这里的）"}
{"time": 1765791557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78548297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（至于工人去哪了，心不在焉中）"}
{"time": 1765791560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337221341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎哎）"}
{"time": 1765791589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843287172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵...我都说不用在意了。\"保持自己的仪态，\"因为我已经习惯了，在你们会掉链子这件事上。\""}
{"time": 1765791591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115383033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“噢”应了一声“那镇长呢？”"}
{"time": 1765791633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408817910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“镇长应该和我们是站在一边的....那女人应该是中间派吧”"}
{"time": 1765791666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343330660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你们这里还真是麻烦，今晚就杀她?\"语气自然"}
{"time": 1765791689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985881048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“随你，你能做到的话，就拜托你了，我早看她不爽了”"}
{"time": 1765791689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602001165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哈哈”莫名有些被气笑了"}
{"time": 1765791711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016220651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（去吧，我在精神上支持你）"}
{"time": 1765791731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960651147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么都能用杀解决的话，哪需要费这么多周章”"}
{"time": 1765791988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464350614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"知道了。\"没继续开口，但是搂着梅梅离远了这两人一点。"}
{"time": 1765792071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350760352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，现在……先去那个破二楼看看？”卡提西亚离远了倒也乐得清闲"}
{"time": 1765792123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694995230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，也可以吧，走？”"}
{"time": 1765792150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166531412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梅梅，我们去买衣服吧?\"手里掂量着昨晚的分成，拉着她往服装店走"}
{"time": 1765792178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138142693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我们走吧，小卡”"}
{"time": 1765792497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433118523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"带着梅丹佐往服装店去"}
{"time": 1765792592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334891117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然外面聚的人很多，但服装店却没几个人，老板百无聊赖的坐在前台，虽然长野是个被抛弃的镇子，不过这里的衣服看着似乎还有一些好看的，看到你们二人进来，老板说了声“欢迎光临”就继续发呆了"}
{"time": 1765792620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117856229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（衣品环节）"}
{"time": 1765792750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250698384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我问梅梅她想要什么衣服)"}
{"time": 1765792757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996672934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不就成了你的衣品环节了吗)"}
{"time": 1765792799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958320153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我说我想要小卡给我挑，不就是你的了）"}
{"time": 1765792834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962007283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（高手）"}
{"time": 1765792837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145104789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "上楼！"}
{"time": 1765792857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100110196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭!）"}
{"time": 1765793950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272681960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "首先挑一套，内搭白色立领衬衫，领口有紫色装饰带与蓝绿色宝石胸针，外罩红色镶金边短斗篷，下装是装饰着金丝的深色紧身短裤，一直收到腰间，裤边缀白色花边，腿穿深色长靴并搭带黄铜装饰的棕色护膝，最后拿一双深色皮质手套，整体兼顾实用与华丽，当然，专门为了匕首选了一条带着金属扣的棕色宽腰带，斜跨着匕首的刀鞘。"}
{"time": 1765794131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545835147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "第二套则是白色宽松长袖裙装打底，领口点缀着黑色蕾丝花边，胸前饰大块蓝宝石与银灰色圆片、衣身做了银丝制作的淡色花纹处理，外搭橙蓝拼接的飘逸披风，下装是深蓝色蕾丝花边短裙，整体比打底的白色裙摆长一小截，腿穿带蕾丝花纹与星星装饰的白色长筒袜，最后搭上棕色皮鞋。"}
{"time": 1765794156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301094148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（dnd的非魔法物品价格怎么算的）"}
{"time": 1765794171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807769866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(很便宜)"}
{"time": 1765794173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885106403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（特指衣服）"}
{"time": 1765794179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652355689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(金币的购买力极高)"}
{"time": 1765794203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410827436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(普通家庭一年只有30个金币)"}
{"time": 1765794206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945571285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你自己算吧)"}
{"time": 1765794226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493504427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(而冒险者，一个魔法物品就要成百上千)"}
{"time": 1765794231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290576976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(低于一千我不买)"}
{"time": 1765794456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55118430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”对方看你买了这两套眼睛就发光了“两位客人真识货啊，这算是我们店最好的衣服了....这样吧，两件一起给你打个折，就收你...5个金币吧”对方顾作艰难的说到"}
{"time": 1765794642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691628880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"五个?\"冷笑一声，面具看向对方，\"这衣服真的值得金币做单位吗？\""}
{"time": 1765794691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165688135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你也不看看这是什么布料，是哪位设计师的伟大作品”"}
{"time": 1765794716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143729329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（英国的派乐盟，没收你52块算好了（））"}
{"time": 1765794741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269348478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一个金币。\"指尖挑出一个金币，弹在桌上。"}
{"time": 1765794775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000639738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“客人像是来挑事的啊，不像买衣服的...四个金币，这是底线了”"}
{"time": 1765795020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976078756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行吧。\"再补给她三个金币，倒也没必要太纠结。"}
{"time": 1765795028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747753625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有试衣间吗？\""}
{"time": 1765795068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761267532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有的有的，就在里面，客人快去试试吧”她兴奋的接过四个金币，然后小心的保管了起来"}
{"time": 1765795105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095662485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，一只手抱着衣服，另一只拉着梅梅进试衣间。"}
{"time": 1765795321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462633407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己当然是当场就换下身上这套已经穿了不知道多久的衣服，换上专门挑好的方便携带匕首的干练服饰，给自己打个马尾，\"我帮梅梅吗？\"指了指剩下这套。"}
{"time": 1765795337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507633329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咦，原来）"}
{"time": 1765795346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678631778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（龙的衣服不是自己变的？）"}
{"time": 1765795464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388908118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?变出衣服属于造物范畴)"}
{"time": 1765795470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791623509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然但是，一般也没人卡)"}
{"time": 1765795478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527449801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我是说真的打dnd的话)"}
{"time": 1765795479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689167223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她变成龙的时候衣服去哪了）"}
{"time": 1765795488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635875223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不然每次你变形爆衣)"}
{"time": 1765795501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697092589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=689167223](我收着啊)"}
{"time": 1765795502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136574773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（正常吧，德鲁伊也是）"}
{"time": 1765795517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349457247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以一般没人卡这个，画风问题)"}
{"time": 1765795547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956777243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....那小卡帮我换衣服吧”"}
{"time": 1765795594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402530787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "她把两只手向上一举，甚至等着你帮忙脱"}
{"time": 1765795606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149558726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（从小看到大？）"}
{"time": 1765795614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987471285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不然呢)"}
{"time": 1765795632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633157023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我自己孵的)"}
{"time": 1765795633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730447609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说变成龙最方便，衣服直接掉了）"}
{"time": 1765795652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349514031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是这样，但是以后体型大了就成爆衣了)"}
{"time": 1765795705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074004426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（建议打数值变化，但体型不变mod（）"}
{"time": 1765795730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721873220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=402530787]\"真是的...\"露出些宠溺的笑容，帮她脱掉之前的衣服，仔仔细细换上新买的裙子，最后披上斗篷，挂好脖子上的饰品，\"怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1765795759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839548461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好看..不愧是小卡”梅梅看着镜子里的自己，满意的转了好几圈"}
{"time": 1765795780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328035779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2145104789]（）"}
