{"time": 1765795818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464653770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃呃）"}
{"time": 1765795827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943211900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看看有没有爬上去的角度"}
{"time": 1765795835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671412870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没有就只能钩锁神力了"}
{"time": 1765795850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244190587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "目测是没有，但旁边有个小巷，不知道里面会不会有些什么"}
{"time": 1765795885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493207171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=839548461]\"哼哼。\"看看镜子里的自己"}
{"time": 1765795950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618460225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "十分的干练，和之前的装束比，看着就有一种很厉害的感觉"}
{"time": 1765796067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963095463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1244190587]“西姆莉试试看开这个锁？”"}
{"time": 1765796090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194103595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"以后...等梅梅成长起来，卡提西亚在梅梅眼中就成小不点了吧?\"拍拍她的脑袋"}
{"time": 1765796112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099843172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=963095463][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “不太好吧...这里正对着广场，开锁也太引人注目了吧...”"}
{"time": 1765796148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649232711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=194103595]“不要...”梅梅摇摇头“那我不想长大了，我想一直眼睛里全都是小卡”"}
{"time": 1765796179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697534162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那去那个小巷子里看看有没有侧门？”探头看看那个巷子"}
{"time": 1765796276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051038407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=697534162][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你看到小巷子里有个摇摇晃晃的梯子，似乎通向二楼"}
{"time": 1765796313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925277717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的，感觉是什么英国特产）"}
{"time": 1765796525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135590037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“上去看看吧……你轻，你先”"}
{"time": 1765796617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671855482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649232711]\"笨，长大是正常的啦。\"亲昵地抱着她，\"虽然现在小小一只也很可爱，但是之后会很高大威猛呢。\""}
{"time": 1765796651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229331953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等我长大了，我要用变形在变回小龙....”"}
