{"time": 1765820137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204270665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很轻松的便打开了“易如反掌啊，我们快进去看看吧”"}
{"time": 1765820206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857175339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，不过应该也没什么有意思的事情，能看到下面就行”"}
{"time": 1765820286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284925915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "如你所料，是个空空如也的房子，不过视线很开阔，可以看到完整的教堂和广场，布道台也能清楚的看到"}
{"time": 1765820317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894194929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先在这吧，一会……说不定还能表演从天而降呢”"}
{"time": 1765820339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804501907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？你要干什么”西姆莉不太懂你想干嘛"}
{"time": 1765820363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156524710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过你也注意到广场上的人越来越多"}
{"time": 1765820422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448559006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然要在最该出现的时候出现了”"}
{"time": 1765820490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046914956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在广场上安静地等着，当然没有佩戴绶带"}
{"time": 1765820499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490896754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm...那你不要搞砸了，我还是按时下去吧，时间好像差不多了”西姆莉拿出绶带佩戴好，然后准备离开"}
{"time": 1765820519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131599188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真热闹，我们什么时候也做个一样的演讲？”把徽章翻出来"}
{"time": 1765820540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371316701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许之后会有机会？我先下去了”"}
{"time": 1765820767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105315137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，反正我有绳子，随时都能下去”"}
{"time": 1765820772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796677715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*留在上面"}
{"time": 1765820779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110443218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "说完西姆莉推开门，把你一个人留在这里，然后下去了"}
{"time": 1765820823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478226209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过一会，你在上面清楚的看到，大家看到西姆莉身上的绶带都有些害怕，西姆莉轻轻松松就挤到了最前排"}
{"time": 1765820963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578688910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们还有什么动作吗）"}
