{"time": 1765870731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283353982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "先转回广场吧，反正服装店也在那边"}
{"time": 1765870811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699548995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "广场上人散的已经差不多了，仅有很少的人还留在这边"}
{"time": 1765870962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173193675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还以为那些油桶是哪个别有用心的人停在那的”看看布道台“结果真就只是工人停在那的……可惜，否则就有机会拿下那个头盔了”"}
{"time": 1765871016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908395408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没办法...毕竟被治安官盯上了”"}
