{"time": 1765871418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421820533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之去服装店了"}
{"time": 1765871573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550301370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "依旧没什么客人的样子，不过老板在看到卡缇希亚这个大客户后也是精神了不少“欢迎光临啊 几位一起的？”"}
{"time": 1765871949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47312311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是，路过。\"语气平静"}
{"time": 1765872020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249978918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "刀依旧不离手，点点头“区别不大，随便看看。”在店里找找比较修身的黑色皮衣。双肩加厚且修直，袖口则是稍有弹性的假两层。背心处开口或竖缝，以免影响动作。裙摆很高，不够风雅的暴露度用套筒处为皮质的长筒丝袜弥补"}
{"time": 1765872025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282181003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=588073579606094CB2EA30051EAF1DD6.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS30MneCtG1Lg20VhfZjWdmHH78SBjNigQg_wookNeT9tHBkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbuX0td332cEGxsu__z0j53oCLreCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMI3T2oW7c7qUOpzc5MoMdfJNdLfXHwpr6XxzFE7GoV6toRMnXrWuspGqWhi-OtHI1Q,file_size=66893]"}
{"time": 1765872028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755638126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对格雷西亚挑衣服一事兴致缺缺，没进门，在外面随便转悠转悠"}
{"time": 1765872045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110496832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "顺便问问“有没有墨镜？大一点的比较好”"}
{"time": 1765872208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585560706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有的有的，等一下”对方去找了一会，随后拿出了一个符合你要求的崭新墨镜"}
{"time": 1765872480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898730402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "戴上墨镜顿感有些天昏地暗，但照了照镜子感觉相当满意“自己说自己特立独行有点奇怪，但，酷。都帮我拿两套吧，多少钱？”"}
{"time": 1765872505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791396629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“两套5金币”"}
{"time": 1765872665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595812368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我的卡好像从不降价）"}
{"time": 1765872670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932885831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（讲价）"}
{"time": 1765872735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108735300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不多说，没必要让讨价还价影响自己的心情。拿出五枚金币"}
{"time": 1765872838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556037741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“欢迎客人多多光顾啊”她收起五枚金币，帮你把另外一套打包了起来"}
{"time": 1765872857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567893688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不错，有点帝国的感觉”把武器横挂在腰后，手扶着刀柄，款款走出店门"}
{"time": 1765872902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548897975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还蛮帅的么”西姆莉感叹道"}
{"time": 1765873132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191548378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也觉得……去看看那个人在晃悠什么呢？”看了看卡提希亚的方向“……哎，你说我是不是贱？每次接触完都会气到自己，但总是莫名对她感到好奇”"}
{"time": 1765873459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484131203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"哎？听起来好像你很喜欢她的样子\""}
{"time": 1765873680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733105574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么可能”翻个白眼“你哪天看到一个和你长得有七八分像人……身边还带着个强的不像话的人，你不好奇？而且看起来精神还不太正常”"}
{"time": 1765873743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680781110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能大概不会好奇吧...”"}
{"time": 1765873782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160364983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1755638126][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 没有遇到什么值得注意的事情，不过那两个人好像已经出来了，格蕾西亚换上一身看起来帅帅的衣服"}
{"time": 1765873898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347755602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有下一步的动作，稍微打量一眼，等在原地"}
{"time": 1765873916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943879951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“简直就像在看另一个自己”摇头“不弄清楚的话，有一种，在旁观自己干些梦中才有的荒谬事情的感觉”"}
{"time": 1765874039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415755645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“说不定其实你们是失散多年的远房亲戚呢”西姆莉开玩笑的说到"}
{"time": 1765874348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089621122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“远房亲戚也不会那么像。近亲……没有那种可能。”说完就闭上了嘴，不再言语。"}
{"time": 1765874604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329652956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那么现在应该做什么呢）"}
{"time": 1765874980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733016952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哇嘎那）"}
{"time": 1765875003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72200643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(逛逛接)"}
{"time": 1765875005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745026120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神好像在等你动，你在等他动）"}
{"time": 1765875009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844338550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(街)"}
{"time": 1765875016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595371579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在等龙神给动作)"}
{"time": 1765875069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401745435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我也不知道去哪啊）"}
{"time": 1765875072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96152004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在几点）"}
{"time": 1765875193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463251111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能大概五六点）"}
{"time": 1765875228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218389242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不是该）"}
{"time": 1765875231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995928058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吃饭了）"}
{"time": 1765875248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423061005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是啊，一开始出来不就说的是去吃饭么）"}
{"time": 1765875267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018857158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那吃完饭干什么呢）"}
{"time": 1765875333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318265336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“饿了，去破釜沉舟吃饭？本来昨天初次会面就该在那的”"}
{"time": 1765875429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999804905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，走吧...该庆祝一下任务圆满成功的”"}
{"time": 1765876132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020214847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1765876378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688137099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你吃饭喊我)"}
{"time": 1765876385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410784825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吗)"}
{"time": 1765876404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474321702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我离你还挺远的)"}
{"time": 1765876415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017280546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不喊一声，我也不知道)"}
{"time": 1765876427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479993780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不是在看这边）"}
{"time": 1765876435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994335750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只是看)"}
{"time": 1765876475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251923960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那应该西姆莉去喊啊（））"}
{"time": 1765876529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726583802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(may be)"}
{"time": 1765876575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836030157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以你在干嘛，发呆？）"}
{"time": 1765876756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905399798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么是西姆莉（））"}
{"time": 1765876780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283137820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(附近瞎逛了一圈，离得比较远看着你们吧)"}
{"time": 1765876783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529518051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡提西亚，梅丹佐，该去吃饭啦”西姆莉朝你们喊了一声"}
{"time": 1765876791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429920636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你们要是动起来，我就跟着一起的状态)"}
{"time": 1765876819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239074601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"吃饭！\"听到这两个字，梅梅感觉更精神了一些"}
{"time": 1765876889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953514179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拢了拢新衣服，\"梅梅身上不是有很多钱吗？\"捏捏她的腰，\"算了。\"由着她，\"一起去吧。\"摘了面具，踱步靠近，\"去哪吃?\""}
{"time": 1765876954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888377188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“破釜沉舟吧...另一家酒馆的话，评价很烂”"}
{"time": 1765876995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166649990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？有多烂？”抬脚往破釜沉舟的方向先迈步"}
{"time": 1765877156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746584155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拦在哪?\"有些异口同声，说完自己先停住了脚，过了一会才动"}
{"time": 1765877339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206075001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那老板自称是为贵族服务，但卖的葡萄酒都是兑水的....”"}
{"time": 1765877386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412072547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这样，居然还没倒闭？”"}
{"time": 1765877444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369727397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧啧，看来这里的贵族也不怎么纯正。\"抬起双手绕到脑后扬扬自己的头发，顺带伸展一下四肢。"}
{"time": 1765877456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708092207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过那一般是应付普通人的，如果真的有贵族去的话，服务态度也许就会好一些了吧”"}
{"time": 1765877478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322282450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过毕竟我又不是贵族，个人体验只能说烂到爆炸”"}
{"time": 1765877659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136315281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喏，这不是有一个自称是贵族，还装得有模有样的？”"}
{"time": 1765877813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412721037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呵呵，总之我还是再也不希望去那边第二次了”"}
{"time": 1765877813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766624085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"翻了个白眼，\"本小姐只是不想当贵族，两年前跑出来了而已。\"调整一下表情，躬身牵起裙摆，微微低头，像过去做了无数次那样，\"贵安，格雷西亚姐姐，西姆莉姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1765877841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199326891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实还挺有模有样的...”"}
{"time": 1765878131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547592965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "懒得再纠有模有样的字眼，\"咦惹...\"身上冒出股恶寒，\"总感觉怪怪的。\""}
{"time": 1765878217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360392908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不想当贵族，真稀奇……”摇摇头“多少人想当都当不上。不过我算是知道卡提西亚妹妹恶劣的性子中的一半是怎么养出来的了”"}
{"time": 1765878218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532903460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过刚刚的卡提西亚感觉甚至还有点可爱”西姆莉忍不住说道"}
{"time": 1765878415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535603347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻个白眼，\"和你们没关系，反正以后也用不上。\"尤其瞪了一眼格雷西亚，\"那个家里的人反正以后我也见不到了。\""}
{"time": 1765878556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437114532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你全给杀了吗？”西姆莉好奇“感觉像是你会做出的事情”"}
{"time": 1765878673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472157067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没，我有那么喜欢杀吗？\"对这话题倒也无所谓，\"只是以后不会遇见他们了吧？只当从来没有过这些。\"抱着梅梅，\"还是梅梅好。\""}
{"time": 1765878684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711960495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(差点我就打出有情有义了)"}
{"time": 1765878707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513029993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只当从来没有过这些）"}
{"time": 1765878718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370253307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的梅梅，个个有情有义）"}
{"time": 1765878734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268031165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么时候自刎归天）"}
{"time": 1765878759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6156787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看着像。你不喜欢的人现在有几个还活着？”"}
{"time": 1765878883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736221088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我知道，格蕾西亚和我不还活的好好的么，至少应该还有两个吧”"}
{"time": 1765878913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991495205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1472157067][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “小卡明明那么好，你们对她的滤镜太厚了啦”梅梅不满的说到"}
{"time": 1765878971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943390444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "和西姆莉对视一眼“行吧，我尽量让我们所有人的滤镜厚度保持一致”"}
{"time": 1765879017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470305696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不喜欢的人很多。\"扫一眼这两人，配合着梅梅点点脑袋，语气娇俏，\"我从来没杀过人嘛...杀人，又不会开心～\""}
{"time": 1765879037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625680299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得梅梅倒是蛮可爱的，小卡要是能有梅梅十分之一就好了”西姆莉感慨道"}
{"time": 1765879056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296748104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哼哼~梅梅当然是最可爱的，不对，不准你说小卡坏话”"}
{"time": 1765879113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242949951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1470305696][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 至于这句话，西姆莉已经懒得吐槽了"}
{"time": 1765879157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136025066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”提速两步走在最前头，心中莫名有些郁结。似乎是，羡慕，求不得"}
{"time": 1765879244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262364231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走这么快干嘛..等下我”西姆莉小步跟上"}
{"time": 1765879318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094736954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不紧不慢地跟着，\"我当然没梅梅可爱。\"捏捏梅梅的脸，\"没问题的这句话。\""}
{"time": 1765880277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090983907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1262364231]“没什么……人家都明着给我们摆脸色了，你怎么还好像完全不在意一样”"}
{"time": 1765880339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396253146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“维护良好的关系是一起工作的基础...吵起来以后工作不顺利了，报酬拿不到怎么办”"}
{"time": 1765880382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912263474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“厉害，希望你能坚持久一点”叹了口气，应该快到了？"}
{"time": 1765880563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070197425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们一路上打打闹闹，很快便到了酒馆"}
{"time": 1765880691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133323049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停下脚步，在外面打量一下"}
{"time": 1765880762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870189152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "五顏六色的木盾和飽經風霜的鹿角懸掛在這個鄉村酒館的牆壁上。頭頂上有一塊城垛形狀的招牌上面寫著「破釜沉舟酒館」——其中的橫豎筆畫被替換成了綠色箭矢。"}
{"time": 1765880771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403655536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(素材复用"}
{"time": 1765880791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037165426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "作为镇子上最热门的酒馆，现在在饭店自然是人满为患"}
{"time": 1765880979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100249199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是该插队了）"}
{"time": 1765880992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786910511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（插队是）"}
{"time": 1765880992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663222719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来徽章是不是没收回）"}
