{"time": 1765881092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112990215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "徽章根本就没有摘，带着一副漠不关心的表情往里走"}
{"time": 1765881103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012407204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上戴着墨镜，本来也就看不出表情"}
{"time": 1765881105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404945279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着前面两人，反正自己是被拉来的，刷她们的脸就好了。打个哈欠，不过有点想试一试自己这张脸的效果，故意走到其中一桌附近。"}
{"time": 1765881207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078100020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=404945279][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 无人在意，大家都在各聊各的，镇子上人那么多，并非所有人都认识格蕾西亚，就连西姆莉，这个在长野镇呆了这么久的人，也不能保证随便找个人就认识她"}
{"time": 1765881240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034640122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（处在臭名昭著与无人在意的叠加态）"}
{"time": 1765881257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953577730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"感觉到了无聊，跟上前面的格雷西亚。"}
{"time": 1765881357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988339148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=112990215][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 绶带还是有威慑力的，看到你是大男爵的人，还是对你退避三分的，而那些本来就认识你的人则是更害怕了"}
{"time": 1765881463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483185867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "找个四人桌先坐下了，摘下墨镜，和那些敢于对视的人一一视线相接"}
{"time": 1765881478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823019445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "碎步跟在后面，自己已经失去逗弄的兴趣了，\"吃什么?\"拉着梅梅坐在对面"}
{"time": 1765881484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989863928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是啊，吃什么）"}
{"time": 1765881511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701907166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1483185867][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 躲开了你的视线，安心吃饭"}
{"time": 1765881514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774626945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有什么）"}
{"time": 1765881523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524615062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“格雷西亚来点吧”"}
{"time": 1765881561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943370741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真不知道有什么好怕的，我连霸王餐都没吃过”摇摇头“我来？也行。”"}
{"time": 1765881574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692690457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我对dnd的食物不懂啊）"}
{"time": 1765881692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673183953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(和现实差不多)"}
{"time": 1765881701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086289837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦，我是说，中世纪)"}
{"time": 1765881745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182880798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（实际上欧洲的菜式一大部分都算老资历吧）"}
{"time": 1765881788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225542485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是)"}
{"time": 1765882007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768794068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "翻开菜单“嗯……酥皮南瓜汤，茄蓉培根千层面，凤尾鱼沙拉，篝火架白肠，鲜虾芝士披萨……有人有忌口吗？”"}
{"time": 1765882096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96982302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此外主食自然是面包"}
{"time": 1765882306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168733625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，懒得描述菜长什么样子了（））"}
