{"time": 1765882466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728611878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要不要放个沙漏，然后说沙子倒尽前，没上菜免费，结果发现沙子其实根本不会掉（））"}
{"time": 1765882534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816824983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1765882541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085083541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那用法师之手不就好了）"}
{"time": 1765882656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2543159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道聊什么啊）"}
{"time": 1765882774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653184514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以。\"打开话题，\"你到底是什么人?\"眯着眼看着格雷西亚，\"你应该不是我家的人吧？\""}
{"time": 1765882819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316686077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"年龄上，难道是什么堂姐?\"倒是没有打理锅家谱，对此不太清楚"}
{"time": 1765882886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146485937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我家的人早就死完了”喝一口水，靠在椅背上“就剩我一个。还是别想沾亲带故的事了”"}
{"time": 1765882977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164972814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2543159]（诸葛奶龙曾说）"}
{"time": 1765882985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860848706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道是巧合?\"指着自己的脸，\"我不信，你肯定在骗我。\""}
{"time": 1765883000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388323445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不去寻找主公，而是去创造一个主公）"}
{"time": 1765883014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688063326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（所以不去寻找话题，应该创造一个话题）"}
{"time": 1765883259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123636789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“骗你对我有什么好处吗？”看看卡提希娅，又看看梅丹佐“我倒是想有个妹妹”"}
{"time": 1765883336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693350774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“格蕾西亚希望你喊她姐姐呢”西姆莉拱火道"}
{"time": 1765883471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239040847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是这样吗？姐姐～\"用一种很自然的语气开口，就像一向如此一般。"}
{"time": 1765883544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482062591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我猜会说我才不要疯子当我妹妹.jpg）"}
{"time": 1765883832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559083363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你不行，其实我比较喜欢梅丹佐”目光挪向另一边"}
{"time": 1765883929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2385932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”梅丹佐明显愣了一下!不行啦，我是小卡的...不过如果小格做了小卡的姐姐，那我就可以做小格的妹妹啦"}
{"time": 1765883982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293690958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶——\"指着自己，\"就算没有血缘关系，也是我和姐姐长得很像吧？\"语气里故意凑出几分落寞，桌下的手拥着梅梅，微微用力，怎么感觉这家伙上赶着凑成这事一样。"}
{"time": 1765884317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577777047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行，我不喜欢你”手指卷起一缕头发吹了吹“但是一般来说我也不喜欢多人所爱。你大可放心”"}
{"time": 1765884377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268033998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在你们聊天的时候，热热腾腾的饭菜和面包也上桌了"}
{"time": 1765884412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516391409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（描述在电脑上，但我出门了）"}
{"time": 1765884430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150537180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1765884445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216793257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会跟你说豆包只要登录了，手机上可以看到电脑的记录）"}
{"time": 1765884470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094857485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=96AB7DA125FFE850F8D70A2903C0E76A.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ54P91t7b7xutMpu5nAAM6Hs8n9xjeWSD_Cijd4Y6kgMKRAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhByVLb-K-b3fq7ZDwSRuuIwegLbeoIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMC4cm6ACC6lN3A2ZVQpFVGpxVLb0pTc7GwyQ4mm1Zf1nRGebk43dDN5XHH0SFwyG6g,file_size=11486]"}
{"time": 1765884521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293394511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻个白眼，\"演演而已啦，搞得好像真的要当你妹妹一样。\"身子抖了一下，\"咦，身上都冒恶寒了。\""}
{"time": 1765884556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485217881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那很可惜了”西姆莉看热闹不嫌事大的说到，然后拿起一片面包开吃"}
{"time": 1765884647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331886955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我要是真有个妹妹，肯定比你好”毫不掩饰地回敬一个白眼“谁稀罕你？”"}
{"time": 1765884772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435927694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿起面包沾点芝士投喂梅梅，\"我要是有姐姐，肯定也不是你这种恶劣的家伙。\"语气里多少透着些漫不经心，\"不稀罕我的人多了，亲人都是，不差你一个。\""}
{"time": 1765884818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103580939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊～”梅梅边吃边接受你的投喂，反正嘴是没空闲下来过"}
{"time": 1765885046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475687589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦。恶劣”居然真的有在反思一下，反思的结果是净他妈扯淡“这桌上唯独你没有资格说别人恶劣”"}
{"time": 1765885233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724042133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(草，被车撞了)"}
