{"time": 1765885456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958671687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(还好没大事)"}
{"time": 1765885485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532937305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=475687589]\"哦～我怎么了?\"语气依然漫不经心，生出几分细嚼慢咽的想法"}
{"time": 1765885756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354983887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喜怒无常肆意妄为欺软怕硬。虽然确实有两把刷子”咬下半截白肠“但是叫人怎么敢和你相处？”"}
{"time": 1765886296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597834449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吧。\"眉头微微皱了皱，放下手里的刀叉，\"梅梅，我们走。\""}
{"time": 1765886442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026335150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么，你原来还会在意别人的评价？”"}
{"time": 1765887065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165832395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没接话，提溜着梅梅，\"走啦。\"语气倒是没什么特别的情绪，不过情感链接里向她隐隐发散了一些微小的压抑着的负面情绪"}
{"time": 1765887179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35981104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别生气啦...这么多菜，我们两个人也吃不完啊”西姆莉劝到"}
{"time": 1765887539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579383417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没有生气。”微笑了一下，“我吃饱了，再见。”碗里还有些夹着没吃的菜，至于梅梅...看看她是什么反应。"}
{"time": 1765887564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126440675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1579383417][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 看起来没有吃饱，但听了你的话有点不敢吃了"}
{"time": 1765887656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974511938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“乖。”带着她起身出去，在她耳边小声开口，“带你出去吃。”"}
{"time": 1765887825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532053692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，好吧”西姆莉叹了口气“之后再见吧”"}
{"time": 1765888188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717367337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "推门离开，出去去刚刚提到的另一个餐厅。"}
