{"time": 1765908631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284241544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "老板看见你进来“请问阁下是？”"}
{"time": 1765908686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393803996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "老板是个女性，看起来面向并不是很和善，用一种很奉承的语气和你交流"}
{"time": 1765908706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741928976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阁下不必知道太多。\"隔着面具开口，袖口还戴着臂章，\"祝您日安，女士。\""}
{"time": 1765908714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373923384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=283797528][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “你啊你..”西姆莉想要说点什么，但最后还是选择了安静吃饭"}
{"time": 1765908760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981733393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大男爵的人？真的假的”对方有点不太相信的样子“感觉之前没见过你啊”"}
{"time": 1765908775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541056856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来……”看着门口的方向“你找她来的时候做过调查么？”"}
{"time": 1765908790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015319819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“家庭、出身什么的”"}
{"time": 1765908795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978343692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都说了，不是我找她来的，是别人推荐的”"}
{"time": 1765908811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272367845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以对那家伙我也算一无所知了”"}
{"time": 1765908834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131336250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“推荐的人也没说什么么……好吧”摇摇头"}
{"time": 1765908895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527873658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也没说🐉的事？）"}
{"time": 1765908915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738770454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“出身啦，背景啦，我也不在乎这些，能好好完成任务才是最重要的...起码目前来看，卡提西亚做事也还可以”"}
{"time": 1765908920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138043312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1981733393]\"与你无关。\"语气平平淡淡，\"懂我意思?上餐吧。\""}
{"time": 1765908952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486961022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的...”对方看起来殷勤了许多“客人想要吃些什么”"}
{"time": 1765909008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560271407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“非要说哪里有问题，大概就是太有个性了”叹了口气“什么都不在意……但总不能真的放她随便来”"}
{"time": 1765909071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938991337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1486961022]找个地方坐下，摇了摇梅梅，\"想吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1765909101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298211694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡吃什么我就吃什么”梅梅乖巧的说到"}
{"time": 1765909195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753573987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"这家伙，暗暗摇头，点一些梅梅之前常吃爱吃的东西，至于自己，跟着吃一些就好了，\"嗯，就这些。\"递给老板"}
{"time": 1765909233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518329477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的，客人您稍微等一下”她一溜烟的就跑到了后厨开始做饭"}
{"time": 1765909260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018600412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡...很不喜欢那两个...家伙吗”梅梅斟酌了一下用词"}
{"time": 1765909371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627119135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梅梅很喜欢?\"没正面回答，反问"}
{"time": 1765909446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886258002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还行吧.....起码不算很讨厌”梅梅摇了摇头“不过小格刚刚那样说小卡还是太过分了，如果她不跟小卡道歉的话，我以后就不理她了”"}
{"time": 1765909638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221640890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说不上讨厌。\"小声开口，\"但是喜欢不上来，所以就是很讨厌。\"低头看着桌子，\"一个把我的脑袋按在水里，一个在旁边拍手叫好，反正，迟早要讨回来。\""}
{"time": 1765909699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877722387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=917292291]（尬黑）"}
{"time": 1765909706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657681952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（拍手叫好在哪）"}
{"time": 1765909732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745067204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83109887]（也许）"}
{"time": 1765909780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773749145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜X﹏X....嗯..小格不道歉的话 我就把她按进水里”"}
{"time": 1765909795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969458472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1745067204]（这时候她还没醒呢）"}
{"time": 1765909887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467715783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事，梅梅不用管这些事。\"伸手摸摸头，\"我不要紧。\""}
{"time": 1765909909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821183545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "菜很快就上了，毕竟就你一个人"}
{"time": 1765909915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515028350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1969458472](好的，一种爱屋及乌的感觉吧也许，其实应该用一丘之貉。)"}
{"time": 1765909935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304123131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“客人满意的话，记得帮我在大男爵面前多美言几句”"}
{"time": 1765909965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745380620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看起来非常的精致，梅梅尝了一口“好吃😋”"}
{"time": 1765909977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947499986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开始大口大口吃了起来"}
{"time": 1765909995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234426794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这倒是没问题。\"随口回答，摘下面具，自己也小口吃起来，比一比味道"}
{"time": 1765910017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871940271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=560271407]“嗯...我们有两个人，应该能拦住他的...”"}
{"time": 1765910036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898073768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234426794][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 自然比破釜沉舟好吃"}
{"time": 1765910239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456330641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己当然吃不下太多，随便吃下一些，在一旁看着梅梅动刀叉，差不多了就准备结账，\"结账。\"看向老板。"}
{"time": 1765910248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842886699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1871940271]你们边聊边吃，很快便吃饱了，当然还剩下一些"}
{"time": 1765910269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730932249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1456330641][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “好的大人，我给您打个折，5个金币就行”"}
{"time": 1765910276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145221815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1871940271]“算了……既然算队友的话。如果她能少说些让人不悦的话，倒也不是不能忍”"}
{"time": 1765910331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500255381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉擦了擦嘴“那我就先走了，格雷西亚记得结下账，饭钱对于现在的你来说应该不算什么...”"}
{"time": 1765910429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588643074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1730932249]既然要装装样子，把五个金币放在桌上。起身敲敲梅梅的脑袋，\"吃得走不动路了?\""}
{"time": 1765910471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596891479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1500255381]“行，明天见”找服务员要两个打包盒，把剩下的都带回家"}
{"time": 1765910607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578303971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..我还能吃...不过等下...emmm”梅梅想了想，小声在你耳边说到“小卡..我什么时候才能变回去...人形虽然很有意思，但还是原来样子比较舒服”"}
