{"time": 1765969605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808230537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他是那种，希望世间没有纷争（）"}
{"time": 1765969697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523622498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=160419938][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 那鳞片也没有胳到你"}
{"time": 1765969807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031021024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "逗了她一会之后给她盖好被子，换好睡衣躺在一边，盖一床被子。自己的心情终究还是不太好，睡觉有些不太安生，但是终究睡过去了。"}
{"time": 1765969890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438698152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1031021024][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你做了个梦，梦里梦到你把西姆莉和格蕾西亚一人被你一只手按在水里，梅梅在旁边为你喝彩"}
{"time": 1765969914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815950427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1765969917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860259917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1765969947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552424357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "第二天，依旧是和昨天的流程一样，西姆莉先去把格蕾西亚叫醒 然后回来时候再来敲卡提西亚的门"}
{"time": 1765969975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149840689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就跟她一起去到灰屋呗"}
{"time": 1765969981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115726445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然一开始很开心，知道是梦境反而更加难受，努力醒过来，一早就坐在床上发呆，\"...\""}
{"time": 1765970070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616171201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅也被敲门的声音吵醒，下意识变成了人形，揉揉眼睛，把衣服穿好"}
{"time": 1765970098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398376143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你们四人又去到了那个房间"}
{"time": 1765970166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798694845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今天不過是普通的跑腿任務，不過還挺適合你們的能力。我昨天晚上和大男爵見了面。”\r\n拉澤拉戈的身影將一隻手指向桌上的一疊捲好的羊皮紙。“他頒布了幾條新法令，希望有人能張貼到鎮子裡通知鎮民。”"}
{"time": 1765970188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604850882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "他懒得寒暄，直接进入了正题"}
{"time": 1765970194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570792308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦。\"没什么精神，简单回复了一句。"}
{"time": 1765970285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216098500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就这样？”有些疑惑“会不会有什么比较敏感的地区？”"}
{"time": 1765970330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141993405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉把那些羊皮纸拿了过来，给你们一人分了一些"}
{"time": 1765970346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722550306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们先看看”里面传来声音"}
{"time": 1765970368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731382970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看看羊皮卷的内容"}
{"time": 1765970388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768548825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着摊开看看，虽然多少带着些漫不经心"}
{"time": 1765970394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871919134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=51B847EC9E3ACAD134E108EC8D48F4B3.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSHs-STpAzTbg3-_Mx8O5PGiPGGFRit0Rcg_wooxuulr8DEkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQpvzEn-0HjZsZDPr9j-xxwHoCJ6uCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMPQtJVP2HpsBHdnsIhN3uQW34yTj-gcpJULYofVSEL6O_nXFq3AhfsfdRKhagTI_XQ,file_size=387245]"}
{"time": 1765970528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919773186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这条法令公布之后会引发什么，自己大概也有所意料，但是，跟自己有什么关系?现在自己更不想待在这两人旁边，\"就这么多?\"简单开了口，\"我现在就去。\""}
{"time": 1765970663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79184956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“將這些張貼到教堂廣場、監獄、破釜沉舟酒館和城堡大門。你們去監獄的時候，順路去一下治安官的辦公室，大男爵還有另外一道命令需要送達。”拉澤拉戈的身影向西姆莉的方向傾斜了一下，後者從桌上拿起一張折起來的紙張。上面寫著“撤銷羅娜·斯泰利什長野鎮治安官之職位”。\r\n “你們有一直到中午的時間來完成任務，希望能像前兩個任務一樣乾淨利落，我會按照約定支付第一個任務的酬金。另外一個任務如果順利的話，大男爵會想見一見你們。聽起來好像很快就會需要人手來填補一些政府職位了。”"}
{"time": 1765970829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088977914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“男爵大人一定有他的深意”虽然感觉有些过于严苛，但还是点点头"}
{"time": 1765970843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452156154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"知道了。\"听起来撤销职位这件事不归自己管，拿上一些传单转身下楼。一刻也不想多待。"}
{"time": 1765970890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666174590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看你们没什么想问的，拉泽拉戈也没多说什么"}
{"time": 1765970915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705691558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉则是拽着格蕾西亚快步跟上了卡提西亚"}
{"time": 1765970938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196756035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么这么急？”"}
{"time": 1765971030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045231298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"目光直视前方，语气平平淡淡，\"有什么特别要问的吗？\""}
{"time": 1765971081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920277193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看你一副想单独行动的样子”"}
{"time": 1765971139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368975193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（罗娜是西姆莉的那个亲戚？）"}
{"time": 1765971148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055820219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1765971162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184181564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"时间紧，我们本来就要分开行动吧。\"依然没看她们，走得很快，\"你去处理你姑姑的事不就好了?\""}
{"time": 1765971232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215357359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪有那么紧，这东西贴的地方本身人就不少，我们还是一起行动防止变数吧...”"}
{"time": 1765971361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025185967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“同意，内容太有争议了。暴民也算长野镇的特产之一”"}
{"time": 1765971379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750441095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"随便你们。\"皱了皱眉，戴上自己的面具，给梅梅也顺手戴上，放慢了一点速度。"}
{"time": 1765971429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779058447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“商量一下顺序吧...先去哪”"}
{"time": 1765971497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248543738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "既然让出了主导权，自己直接一声不吭，等着这两人做决定。"}
{"time": 1765971537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145626281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先去监狱好了，总不至于一过去就遇上暴乱”"}
{"time": 1765971538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846554428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，我强调一下”西姆莉跑到卡缇希亚面前看着她说“不要在大街上杀人”"}
{"time": 1765971572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215704764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果咱们先动手的话”"}
{"time": 1765971730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601129682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"一脚踢开一个石子，\"哦。\"有些不耐烦，手按在自己的腰间。"}
{"time": 1765971746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119705887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=34EF0057DFA42F50695629DD7751DC1F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQTmUhDT1jCw6ff4hVufnuSGW1OKRiR8QMg_wooi7XetMXEkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQCC8JTilBkGIl2fk11bGPlnoCAsuCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMPQtJVP2HpsBHdnsIhN3uQW34yTj-gcpJULYofVSEL6O_nXFq3AhfsfdRKhagTI_XQ,file_size=63633]"}
{"time": 1765971763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363879252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们接下来商量一下方略吧...”"}
{"time": 1765971777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006925298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是偷偷贴还是光明正大贴”"}
{"time": 1765971805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243904736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“制定计划可是很重要的一环”"}
{"time": 1765971845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134195602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不吱声，等着她们两商量，不过自己主张光明正大张贴，这种事偷偷弄反而没有威慑力"}
{"time": 1765971959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905099632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然是光明正大贴。偷摸贴的算什么公告？”说是这么说，心里也有些忐忑。“长野重新被男爵掌控只是迟早的事”"}
{"time": 1765972017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289056342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡缇希亚呢？你怎么看”"}
{"time": 1765972037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874708653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"随便你们。\""}
{"time": 1765972106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907633302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就按格蕾西亚说的办吧”"}
{"time": 1765972130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275934715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走吧，我们先去监狱”"}
{"time": 1765972131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286383392", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们踏上了前往监狱的路途"}
{"time": 1765972150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028852776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你们踏上了前往监狱的路途"}
{"time": 1765972242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972167880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是）"}
