{"time": 1765977091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620199448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=7FACCB3FC09C4EDFD19692A39CF44D81.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS-R11aPJ3jhyU_MVcuv6dfLtekJhjNsRIg_wooqIKPqdnEkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ6_kVmuk-b5tYqVmYwVqc9HoCBxeCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMIwULFyyPW46LJjg6fME4DMYG576z_cIezDsNAYVB3aXhSng7srL_2RawXeqTqfkEQ,file_size=301261]這座低矮的建築由高低不平的石頭砌成，窗户裝著鐵柵欄，看上去就像一座微型堡壘。儘管在招牌下面掛了一排馬蹄鐵，但是這並沒有讓招牌上的「監獄」倆字看起來有絲毫友善的感覺。兩個空蕩蕩的木質頸手枷立在這棟建築前面。"}
{"time": 1765977116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646146183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说不定我也进去过）"}
{"time": 1765977174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546207574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“治安官办公室就在侧面那个房间”西姆莉说到“我们先去监狱贴吧”"}
{"time": 1765977264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599649047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”点点头“上次来这里还是上次”"}
{"time": 1765977270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341468991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"言简意赅"}
{"time": 1765977284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124806715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神是在粥吗）"}
{"time": 1765977299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191319417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是）"}
{"time": 1765977319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035661217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说好像也不用进去，直接贴外面就好了”"}
{"time": 1765977331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983027287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“格蕾西亚你来贴吧”"}
{"time": 1765977338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665518129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是不是还得进去传话么……不过贴完再说吧”"}
{"time": 1765977375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433931158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从不知道哪里拿出来一瓶胶水，找找布告栏。没有的话就贴门边"}
{"time": 1765977503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84999166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在你贴的时候，治安官和她的四个手下注意到了你们，出来查看了一下情况，他们几人在你身后看看你贴的什么东西"}
{"time": 1765977580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706192310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会太严厉了”几个警员小声的交流到，不过罗娜没有说什么"}
{"time": 1765977627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480986039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉戳了戳卡提西亚，把那封解雇的牛皮纸交给了她“你去跟那女人说这件事吧”"}
{"time": 1765977634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896072322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊?我?\""}
{"time": 1765977642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63729164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是你姑姑吗？\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1765977926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278806557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没动，等她的动静"}
{"time": 1765977972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77146583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不喜欢她.....你去吧”"}
{"time": 1765977984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018067289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=706192310]面无表情地贴完，并不打算解释"}
{"time": 1765978041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543689751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看着法令罗娜的脸色有些发黑，但还是没说些什么，底下的警员倒是议论声音越来越大了"}
{"time": 1765978182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238929236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行吧。\"撇撇手"}
{"time": 1765978217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562325566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走上前，\"罗娜小姐，您被，撤职了。\"语气平淡，像是宣布一件小事"}
{"time": 1765978349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481636513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”对方有些震惊“文件呢”显然有些不太相信"}
{"time": 1765978582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200172212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（文件在哪呢所以）"}
{"time": 1765978588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152317665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像在西姆莉身上？）"}
{"time": 1765978597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511004603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（已经给卡提西亚了啊（））"}
{"time": 1765978598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746290148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "交出文件，\"你被解雇了。\""}
{"time": 1765978615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700139709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对方有些难以置信的读了两三遍...."}
{"time": 1765978679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227691187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是大势所趋”看着她，言尽于此"}
{"time": 1765978698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957504560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "相比于罗娜，她手下的反应更大一些“怎么能这样”“这不公平”“罗娜治安官明明做的很好...”"}
{"time": 1765978858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388777338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不清楚，我只是代为传话。\"打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1765978877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773385539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"任命已经下达，可有异议?\""}
{"time": 1765978881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099797769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "罗娜脱下了她的黑衫，上面有切里亚斯的象徽，并把她的长剑重重拍在桌子上，她取走了自己的十字弓，随后简单收拾了自己的东西，强忍着难受的心情说到“我不担心我会怎么样.....但我担心镇民在你们这群流氓的引导下会变成什么样子...”她说完这话抬头看了会天，随后离开，在这途中，她没有去看西姆莉一眼"}
{"time": 1765978908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538430622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉也一直低着头，没有说什么"}
{"time": 1765979118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507816544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少不会让教会的人继续骑在镇民头顶。日子不会有什么区别的”"}
{"time": 1765979132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157085665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不引导镇民。\"皱了皱眉，放下面具，\"这件事与我无关，如果您有需要，可以找我。\""}
{"time": 1765979181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544188667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么看不懂伊神再说什么，又像甩锅，又要承担）"}
{"time": 1765979241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473748936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我的意思是我的立场站在中间)"}
{"time": 1765979257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249228754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果她有必要，找我谈谈也可以。)"}
{"time": 1765979286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452579155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "罗娜没有说什么直接离开了，但她的手下似乎就不像她那么冷静了"}
{"time": 1765979357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718788190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这不对劲，你们把镇子上最公正的人赶跑了，这绝对不对劲”有个人情绪激烈，甚至把自己的弩拔了出来，不过大部分人都看着格蕾西亚"}
{"time": 1765979357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017951194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "重新扣上面具，\"拜拜。\"这群手下怎么想，和我无关。"}
{"time": 1765979373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944321344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打算就此离开"}
{"time": 1765979459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292586120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“公正？随你们怎么想。公正不是坏事，但它不必要”手按在剑柄上“你们呢？现在打算先一步打破安定？”"}
{"time": 1765979640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712653905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉也站在你身旁，准备拔出匕首"}
{"time": 1765979682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258511880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我也可以走，吗？）"}
{"time": 1765979697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055705657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在门口，\"要打吗?\"难得有些有兴趣"}
{"time": 1765979704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389586717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了”对面有一个看起来比较冷静的人“我们没有必要和这家伙计较，她只是个嚣张点的工具人罢了...”她也脱下自己的黑衣，转身离开了，其他的人也纷纷效仿"}
{"time": 1765979815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876127996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……看起来他们打算罢工了”摇摇头，看着西姆莉"}
{"time": 1765979840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841247567", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这不就是那位大人预料的事情么”"}
{"time": 1765979856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898426720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这不已经在那位大人预料之内了么”"}
{"time": 1765979889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134337396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055705657]（所以你到底走不走）"}
{"time": 1765979935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513376756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rh"}
{"time": 1765979935, "type": "reply", "message_id": "513376756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1765979935, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "513376756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[伊恩]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1765979939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980117527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是监狱不能没人看管”"}
{"time": 1765980012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952651819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"反正监狱里现在也没人\""}
{"time": 1765980083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018928689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？原来没人吗”"}
{"time": 1765980146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287676385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(等着啊)"}
{"time": 1765980150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911941846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我这不是)"}
{"time": 1765980262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639254535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那不管了”*摇头“去下一个地方吧”"}
{"time": 1765980263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451866250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“罗娜那家伙比起把犯人关监狱里，更喜欢把人拷在外面”西姆莉指着门外的手枷"}
{"time": 1765980285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141780082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么恶趣味……”"}
{"time": 1765980285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488850139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么无聊?\"打个哈欠，\"监狱里没有人，和没有监狱有什么区别?\""}
{"time": 1765980293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328291859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”西姆莉面无表情，你也不知道她在想什么"}
{"time": 1765980377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701480658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下来去？”"}
{"time": 1765980482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081143498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去教堂呗，这地方有意思。\""}
{"time": 1765980494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33521541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "突然意识到了什么，闭上了嘴，\"不知道。\""}
