{"time": 1766026848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759235821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本来不打算说自己的意见么)"}
{"time": 1766026967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153496369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“监狱的人反应都这么强烈了，教堂方面只怕是不会善了”耸耸肩“所以趁早。西姆莉，之前托你买的卷轴呢？”"}
{"time": 1766027004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454108672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦...买了买了”她在包里翻了翻，把那六张卷轴递给了你"}
{"time": 1766027172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762856904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，有了这个，真要打起来应该也不怕了”接过卷轴“走吧”"}
{"time": 1766027187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394411319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（重压之刃能把我的1d10干到2d8去）"}
{"time": 1766027205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819410773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（期望高了足足4点说是）"}
{"time": 1766027287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935089898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在旁边稍微扫一眼，并没有开口。"}
{"time": 1766027352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743397332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，对了”从里面分出两张隐藏阵营给卡提希娅“认识你们的人还不多，这个还算有点作用”"}
{"time": 1766027425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449799457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小格，这算是对小卡的道歉吗”梅梅看着你两问到"}
{"time": 1766027446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732872054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“出于实用性的考虑罢了”"}
{"time": 1766027505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862801660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"给....\"闻言抱起手，\"我不要。\""}
{"time": 1766027539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424465512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不要”梅梅也抱起手"}
{"time": 1766027665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097241015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“值50金币呢，不要就算了”耸耸肩，把卷轴收好，继续往教堂走"}
{"time": 1766027714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780041855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们又来到了那个熟悉的教堂广场，与昨天相比，这里看起来冷清了不少，教堂廣場的花壇旁邊，豎立著一個十五呎高的木頭公告欄，無數用釘子和灰泥黏貼的褪色公告貼在上面。頂端是一個青銅弓手的風向標，隨風嘎嘎作響。"}
{"time": 1766027754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075951495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就贴那个公告栏上吧， 當地的新聞、商業廣告和不怎麼重要的舊法令都張貼在那里”"}
{"time": 1766027825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157834955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有接话，抱着手在旁边看着，就当在帮着警戒。"}
{"time": 1766027899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632229324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，话说镇上弓箭的元素还真不少”看一眼风向标，随后把公告贴在布告栏的正中间"}
{"time": 1766027928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016760424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（关于那个风向标可以过知识本地）"}
{"time": 1766027947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127378048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+7"}
