{"time": 1766027960, "type": "reply", "message_id": "500318846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20+7={13}+7=20"}
{"time": 1766027981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497234250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那在你贴东西的时候，一个女子靠了过来，在你后面看了看这是什么，随后一些镇民也围了上来"}
{"time": 1766028019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982702360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这宵禁简直是把大家当囚犯”“这不公平”诸如此类的抱怨此起彼伏"}
{"time": 1766028062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629063098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+5"}
