{"time": 1766032271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605190351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "格蕾西亚正准备往墙上涂胶水的时候，波尔加特·卡根老板冲了出来"}
{"time": 1766032272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111756184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道，反正我卢仙滑上去一个被动双枪点了蒙多一千）"}
{"time": 1766032317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438684256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们干嘛...这么往我这么干净的墙上涂什么东西”他一手抓著一柄堅固的大木勺，另外一手拎著半鍋辣椒醬，看起来非常的生气"}
{"time": 1766032404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505694592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"公事公办。\"摊摊手，\"有问题和男爵大人说吧。\""}
{"time": 1766032428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144288125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“领主的告示。”抖开来给他看看“要求贴在这里。如果你不愿贴在墙上，那就个别的能贴的地方”"}
{"time": 1766032433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060085350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（指个）"}
{"time": 1766032458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691558990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么男爵大人....什么法令...给我看看”他凑过去，看看那纸上写了什么"}
{"time": 1766032521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418675406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡觉！）"}
{"time": 1766032542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599689602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
