{"time": 1766044472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94357106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好醒，比蒋干之醒还要好）"}
{"time": 1766044547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181753147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "他的脸色逐渐阴沉“混蛋，这玩意贴了，我的生意怎么做啊”"}
{"time": 1766044633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672495590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“接着做你的，又不是只有你这一家贴这个。”面不改色“这布告难不成还会催吐？”"}
{"time": 1766044696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256515599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行...不准贴，你拿回去让大男爵重新写....”"}
{"time": 1766044827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260142641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我没这个资格让大男爵收回成命，你当然也没有。”皱眉“只是贴在这里不会影响你的生意，你坚持抗命的话，可就未必了”"}
{"time": 1766044908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282596079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么不会....人数一限制，我还怎么做...你这混蛋”他越说越生气，随后把手上那锅辣椒酱朝你扔了过去"}
{"time": 1766044943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711879539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+4 接触"}
