{"time": 1766045103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328018443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过辣椒酱有些烫"}
{"time": 1766045117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296528706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（造成了1点伤害）"}
{"time": 1766045327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528692020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”低头看着自己的新衣服，强压着怒气“最后说一遍，这布告不止贴你这一处。你不让贴在你这，来的人一样不会多。如果你有问题，自己去找领主大人辩论。但你若是再三阻拦，按公告所述，依律收监待审。”"}
{"time": 1766045398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863024408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "他也觉得自己的做法有些过火了，没有和你多说什么，直接逃走了"}
{"time": 1766045458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733310823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无聊。\"还以为会有什么发展，翻了个白眼。"}
{"time": 1766045485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937516229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "把布告交给西姆莉，自己动手拍掉身上的辣椒酱“西姆莉，你来吧。”"}
{"time": 1766045562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658705758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你脾气还真好啊....”她接过布告，然后递给了你一些纸"}
{"time": 1766045825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381415185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后拿出一个小钉子，和小锤子"}
{"time": 1766045827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911039752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“特殊时期，我们代表着领主的态度”接过纸，摇摇头“过于强硬，容易带来过多不稳定因素。”"}
{"time": 1766045841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967869626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把布告钉在了墙上"}
{"time": 1766045918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040973425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你先回去换套衣服？还是先去把事情做完”"}
{"time": 1766045988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031032165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还好是黑的，还是皮衣，影响不大”把用过的纸一抛“只差一个地方了，城堡门口”"}
{"time": 1766046202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125755023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，还是太守序了）"}
{"time": 1766046268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612152535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“何况现在治安官还没决定，监狱也没人，抓了人都不知道要送去哪”"}
{"time": 1766046390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25764880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...走吧，去大门吧”西姆莉把工具收了起来，你们继续向大门方向走了"}
{"time": 1766046492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166221239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚那个布告栏上的弓手是一个叫艾丽萨的家伙，她曾經幹掉了一個盤踞在默語森林劫掠這座城鎮的強盜頭子卡利斯伯洛，因此被称作强盗终结者被大家纪念”梅梅看大家好像都不怎么说话，于是说出了这件事，希望活跃活跃气氛"}
{"time": 1766046645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704235008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，难怪”有一搭没一搭地接下去“什么时候的事？”"}
{"time": 1766046723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711923318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很多年以前的事情了”"}
{"time": 1766046773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010839919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看你回她了，梅梅继续对你说“小格，你能不能跟小卡道个歉，你昨天的话太过分了”"}
{"time": 1766046826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584307384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（小卡又不见了）"}
{"time": 1766046830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121035757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拉了拉梅丹佐，到底是没开口。"}
{"time": 1766046840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436895093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也没我事啊)"}
{"time": 1766046911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346014571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想发一个很逆天的图片）"}
{"time": 1766046985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744106017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“过分？”脚步慢了些“过分在哪？何况是她说我恶劣在先。我有哪句说错了吗？”"}
{"time": 1766047121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460779726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么图）"}
{"time": 1766047123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539696057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和梅梅没关系。\"撇开视线，把梅梅拉到自己身后，没好气地翻了翻白眼，对着格雷西亚开口\"你也闭嘴。\""}
{"time": 1766047139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123689785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是你想看的（）"}
{"time": 1766047159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959527673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B22C939B647E09B91F272ACE8EF68420.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT5it_HtIcd2YXGeLXpcp7QA7JMhxiIugkg_woo6vemrN7GkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQVNLOJSolFj1qyis8XWfWFnoCPt-CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMDDddqhE0FLrrstAICEst4siGxlOpU1W3CJu9kTXeFrTk_MEDUGpQLi2CZP0KUwwzQ,file_size=154888]"}
{"time": 1766047260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882876347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1766047279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582079451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点太逆天了)"}
{"time": 1766047450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711135638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥被吓死了？）"}
{"time": 1766047485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623820865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“切……有人能一直站在旁边的感觉真不错，对不对？”或许有些酸溜溜地说了一句，头也不回地往前走"}
{"time": 1766047568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340347572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们一行人很快便走到了城堡门"}
{"time": 1766047596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882943408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "長野鎮的西大門看起來就像是一個巨人從堅固邊境要塞那裡拆了一扇石門並扔到通往鎮子的路上一般。一扇飽經風霜的木門加裝在異常穩固的石頭中間。"}
{"time": 1766047643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247826367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "這個城門只是一個長滿青苔的石塔，連接著一個矮石墩，將環繞小鎮齊胸高的古老木柵欄從中截斷。"}
{"time": 1766047703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965984639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是个石门”抬头仰望“应该不会有人再来阻碍了吧”"}
{"time": 1766047729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166647156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一路上都未曾再开口，现在自然也不会接话。"}
{"time": 1766047881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878552015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打定主意贴完这张告示就先行离开"}
{"time": 1766048005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185537430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咦，其实）"}
{"time": 1766048015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477639457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也没动手贴过啊（））"}
{"time": 1766048041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565244526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们好啊”塔楼旁有个遮阳棚，一个老奶奶在那里休息，她是波卢西亚，算是这里的看门人，不过长野镇的居民——尤其是年轻人，会把她和她丈夫当做和治安官平起平坐的官员"}
{"time": 1766048054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330564560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(让我跟着一起罢了，我负责解雇你)"}
{"time": 1766048091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158448846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么还有波吕西亚的事）"}
{"time": 1766048096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884253026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是还有波吕克斯）"}
{"time": 1766048113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854013592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对着老人家和善地点点头，算是问了好。"}
{"time": 1766048146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737630336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也点点头，不过还是办事优先，把告示贴在石塔的显眼处，路过的人都能看得到"}
{"time": 1766048242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80581728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们在干嘛...”她有些好奇的过来看了看这边的法令"}
{"time": 1766048268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794956541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=94B94FBCC7D0D103E9B0E49B83F24721.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSWWM2l6WlvELN09-ljQ-CK-lJQUxiU4Acg_woo_LS0veLGkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQvKvbbXewsMDjHq0OGpul73oCfyaCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMDDddqhE0FLrrstAICEst4siGxlOpU1W3CJu9kTXeFrTk_MEDUGpQLi2CZP0KUwwzQ,file_size=126996]"}
{"time": 1766048290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320286955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可能不止)"}
{"time": 1766048298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851203863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点变态）"}
{"time": 1766048354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415882713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感觉应该没有自己的事情了，看了看梅梅，对她开口，\"我准备走了。\""}
{"time": 1766048427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111778751", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么可以这样...”那老婆婆感觉天塌了一般男爵和他的“十八年來，我們一直守護著鎮子，除了節假日和夜晚之外，這道大門一直都是暢通無阻的，我和丹一直照看著它！你们不能关了它....不能...”"}
{"time": 1766048456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778825413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "她用近乎乞求的语气说道"}
{"time": 1766048559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419324571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(梅梅回一下，不回我不好确定怎么走)"}
{"time": 1766048564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906181956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（插进了奇怪的字）"}
{"time": 1766048595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566287909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么可以这样...”那老婆婆感觉天塌了一般“十八年來，我們一直守護著鎮子，除了節假日和夜晚之外，這道大門一直都是暢通無阻的，我和丹一直照看著它！你们不能关了它....不能...”"}
{"time": 1766048618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451179416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1415882713][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “咦？等会不是还要一起去交任务么...小卡要单独去吗”"}
{"time": 1766048727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370260581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她们交不就好了？\"至此已经没什么兴趣了，转身就走，目的地，大概会去教堂看看。"}
{"time": 1766048785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789485202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是领主大人的指令”抿了抿嘴，但不打算心软“这很突然，但我相信这有必要。因为光复骑士团的举措更突然。为了唯一正确的道路，长野镇需要更明确的领导。”"}
{"time": 1766048789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795781882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一还有后续的情况呢？”"}
{"time": 1766048817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854154512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....小卡能确定今天只有这些事情了吗”"}
{"time": 1766048889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507438148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且”顿了顿“只是座门，两位不舍昼夜守了这么多年，不值得再守下去了。找些更值得做的事吧。”"}
{"time": 1766048921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860068105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854154512]（去别的地方可能也有后续的事情.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766048985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703911183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么能...这么说...”这时候另一个守门人也过来了“发生了什么事”，“丹，她们说大男爵要把大门关了....”“怎么可以这样...一群混蛋...”"}
{"time": 1766049043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892215584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854154512]\"那些，和我还有关系吗？\"指着自己，\"反正我阴晴不定，肆意妄为，欺软怕硬，没人可以和我相处。\"声音不大，\"走了。\""}
{"time": 1766049065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403103698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？小卡准备离开长野了吗？”"}
{"time": 1766049072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101947941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们下来去哪....”"}
{"time": 1766049092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196907383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅有些跳跃的说到"}
{"time": 1766049203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753357025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“关门和混蛋有什么关系？”颇有些不解“为了长久的繁荣，还有为了抵御光复骑士团，暂时的管控很难理解吗？”"}
{"time": 1766049250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952829850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然你只在这里呆了两年，但你也知道大部分人觉得這個大門是小鎮勇氣與決心的象徽，因此對於城鎮榮譽門衛來說，戍守城門是一項莊嚴的任務"}
{"time": 1766049285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623030266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡不是说要做出一番大事业的么...怎么中途放弃了”"}
{"time": 1766049341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297489934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下次这么重要的事能不能早说（））"}
{"time": 1766049347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597020630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁说我要离开长野了？\"捏了捏她的脸，微微用力，\"只是看上去，今天这两人应该搞得定吧。我们去别处转转\""}
{"time": 1766049410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822556652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那这次任务的奖励，小卡也不要了吗.....”"}
{"time": 1766049439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817874630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一那两个家伙，把小卡的钱拿去分了怎么办”"}
{"time": 1766049634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284533389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该不会...\"摇摇脑袋，\"唉，我留下来就是了。\"松开手，有些烦躁感无处宣泄，自顾自闷着。"}
{"time": 1766049668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635733795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=753357025]“又不是要把城门拆了。总有一日，这道门会再开的”"}
{"time": 1766049719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966564345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且，两位说不定还能继续看守大门——禁止任何人进出就好”"}
{"time": 1766049751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5852195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗....希望你不要骗我们两个老人...”随后他们伤心的互相搀扶的回塔楼了"}
{"time": 1766049768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353840821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过此刻门还是开着的，可能要靠你来手动关下门了"}
{"time": 1766049791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523325236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就，关门落锁"}
{"time": 1766049806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400576675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（力量检定，dc12）"}
{"time": 1766049827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817550131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+3"}
{"time": 1766049827, "type": "reply", "message_id": "817550131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[芭芙娜]演奏出: 1D20+3={18}+3=21"}
{"time": 1766049844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335650263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那门虽然重，但你还是轻松的就关上了"}
{"time": 1766049846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191201195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了”"}
{"time": 1766049856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982507654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们回去领赏吧”西姆莉开心的说到"}
{"time": 1766049928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132238183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“希望能见到男爵大人。我有好几个问题想问。”"}
{"time": 1766049956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334700389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "几次深呼吸才勉强压住心底的烦躁，踢开几个石子，转身就走"}
{"time": 1766050047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147318565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "回！"}
{"time": 1766050110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349351518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "面无表情地穿过街道，心中也有些忧虑"}
{"time": 1766050132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909166923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，心情看着都很差”"}
{"time": 1766050178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498904477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉看你们都不怎么开心的样子，她看起来还好，仿佛之前被开除的不是她姑姑一样"}
{"time": 1766050383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932907098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扫了她一眼，偏回头，看了看四周，吐出话语，\"打一架吧。\""}
{"time": 1766050399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619330313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我担心男爵大人的决断操之过急，镇上的人都有自己的想法，我怕这些决断会引起暴乱……什么？”"}
{"time": 1766050420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062863416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“1v1,2v1，还是2v2?”"}
{"time": 1766050446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834071505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果，我是说如果）"}
{"time": 1766050455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075861265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和梅丹佐打，能吃到人类宿敌吗）"}
{"time": 1766050463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352021091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃不到啊）"}
{"time": 1766050543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227304485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"决斗。\"语气平静，看向格雷西亚，\"既分高下，也决生死。\""}
{"time": 1766050580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007734929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后你和我打之前要先上个法甲，再上个护盾术？）"}
{"time": 1766050635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650548398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"决生死也太过了吧...\"西姆莉忍不住吐槽道"}
{"time": 1766050655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917666083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不上吧)"}
{"time": 1766050664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94820173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在这？”看了看周围的环境“原因？”"}
{"time": 1766050682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63484228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（游荡者solo战士吗）"}
{"time": 1766050688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104599429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很烦。\""}
{"time": 1766050699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744696592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=94820173][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你们已经到了外面的林子里，周围没什么人"}
{"time": 1766050773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518811097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=917666083]（那我上个重压之刃的卷，感觉一刀就能砍翻你啊（））"}
{"time": 1766050840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383141836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你生命骰多少）"}
{"time": 1766050946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972151156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也行，正好我也不想就这样下去”"}
{"time": 1766050970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698006735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，随你们吧”西姆莉稍微离远了一些，害怕被你们波及"}
{"time": 1766050989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497751934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡...真的不用我帮忙吗”梅梅小声在卡提西亚耳边说道"}
{"time": 1766051149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760411801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡如果被她杀了....我该怎么办...”"}
