{"time": 1766051977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28775773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760411801]\"那...梅梅就离开吧。\""}
{"time": 1766052001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381682698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行，你们不准打架...”梅梅站在中间"}
{"time": 1766052227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851595261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么我一定会输?\"皱皱眉，烦躁更甚"}
{"time": 1766052343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482810744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就算小卡赢的概率是80，我也不会让小卡和她决斗的...万一就遇到那20％了呢...梅梅不能没有小卡...小卡实在讨厌那家伙的话，就让我来吧，我来和格蕾西亚决斗...”"}
{"time": 1766052360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405747503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我怎么打呢）"}
{"time": 1766052373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225210153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我打银龙？）"}
{"time": 1766052498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812721302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"猛吸了一口气，\"不打了。\"能听出生生压着的语气，\"回去。\"额角抽了抽。"}
{"time": 1766052550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641959452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不决生死不就好了”靠近了些，不太打算就这么算了"}
{"time": 1766052643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986509623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行...小卡既然这么讨厌她，我来帮你教训她...”梅丹佐转身看向格蕾西亚“公平起见...我就出一招...如果你能挨过去就算你赢....”"}
{"time": 1766052788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771955246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，你能代表她？”看着身高略逊自己的两人，羡慕逐渐有向嫉妒演变的趋势"}
{"time": 1766052841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526046542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之你要挑战小卡，得先过我这关...”梅丹佐也不准备管你答不答应，深深吸了一口气"}
{"time": 1766052859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686762984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"皱了皱眉，从身后拉住梅梅，挡在她身前，\"虽然梅梅确实能代表我，但是这里。\"抽出匕首，\"我非自己来不可。\""}
{"time": 1766052966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723149450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看你们终究还是要决斗，梅梅还是不太认可，不想让小卡受伤...梅梅的脸逐渐鼓了起来"}
{"time": 1766053062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105467457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后一阵强大的气息从她的嘴里喷出“哈~~~~”波及到了你们二人"}
