{"time": 1766053552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617328598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡不想动手的话，就让我来吧....”梅梅逐渐靠近倒地的格蕾西亚"}
{"time": 1766053587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830218110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（往日种种）"}
{"time": 1766053647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815406016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎哎，我可不能眼睁睁的看你们把这家伙杀了...”西姆莉挡在了格蕾西亚前面“说到底，为什么会到今天这步”"}
