{"time": 1766054149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424222245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1815406016]拉住梅梅，自己的心情，有些难以言明，有些气笑了，但同时也不好指责梅梅，\"梅梅，就这样吧。我已经没什么想做的了。\""}
{"time": 1766054204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776025768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过了大概20s左右，你觉得自己基本已经好了[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1766054283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101495357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从地上爬起来，看了看这两个神人，没敢再说什么，面对着他们后退直到离开"}
{"time": 1766054308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109112000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2101495357]（什么意思）"}
{"time": 1766054360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685126256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（面对着他们倒退跑路啊）"}
{"time": 1766054381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099347730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎哎，你要去哪”西姆莉拉住了你"}
{"time": 1766054413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069702573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“放开我”甩开她的手“留在这里我会死的”"}
{"time": 1766054514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475104971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "与其说是气消了，不如说是，生生被压住了，毕竟...那个时候连着自己也被卷了进去，\"梅梅...\"深深吐出口气，看向格雷西亚，脸上挂着深深的挫败和疲惫，\"...不会找你茬了，格雷西亚小姐。\"迈步离开"}
{"time": 1766054575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754694255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧...我不是还在这的么，你怕什么”"}
{"time": 1766054739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223569394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你又不是没看见，那个梅丹佐，你怎么拦得住她？”心有余悸，视线里似乎还有倒地的时候，梅丹佐一步步逼近的残像"}
{"time": 1766054770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831045990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然那家伙很厉害，但我也不弱，所以你别害怕”"}
{"time": 1766054863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701635069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，我说的话你没听见?)"}
{"time": 1766054886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507884804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1475104971]罕见地没有拉着梅梅，自己往前走"}
{"time": 1766054895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509990052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是梅丹佐说的（）"}
{"time": 1766055031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996210654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……她们能一直在一块，你能一直站在我这边吗？”咬了咬牙，白了她一眼"}
{"time": 1766055054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163083811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（梅丹佐，不可战胜的）"}
{"time": 1766055176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033743869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧...至少在长野，咱两肯定是一伙的”西姆莉也白了你一眼“在之后的事..我也不知道”"}
{"time": 1766055193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671233671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能好感度刷的不够）"}
{"time": 1766055253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407174967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(梅梅还站在原地?)"}
{"time": 1766055256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107238741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了...她们不敢随便杀你的，毕竟你也算是大男爵的人，他肯定不希望你们会内斗的”"}
{"time": 1766055300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934405304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小格，对不起”梅梅朝格蕾西亚鞠躬到了个歉，也不管回应，小步跟上了卡提西亚，但不太敢说话"}
{"time": 1766055314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787034457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那就别当老好人啊？”情绪有些失控，音量都大了些“怎么总帮她打圆场？见面的第一天，她就已经想着杀我了，你还劝我让她和我住一起？”"}
{"time": 1766055382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322548673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=787034457]（实际上两边都是一样的（）"}
{"time": 1766055391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71086232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（梅梅也算老好人）"}
{"time": 1766055443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650498150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934405304]和一个刚刚还打算认真干掉自己的人当然没什么好说的。但卡提希娅说的话却莫名感觉不是假话"}
{"time": 1766055547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151913366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那和她一起工作是客观事实啊，还能怎么办..你要是天天都担心被杀，我们怎么进行的好工作...”西姆莉有些无语“你如果害怕她们的话，要么想办法解决她们，要么就此退出吧....泽拉泽戈大人告诉过我，这次任务完成之后，他就可以带我们去见大男爵，如果你选择在这种时候退出，我也不会多说什么，就当我西姆莉看错了人吧”"}
{"time": 1766055564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188335965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（今日错看了你，明日也错看了你.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766055651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201272241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走得很快，丝毫没有要等着谁的意思，知道梅梅跟在身后，但是没有任何想说的话，表情木然。"}
{"time": 1766055691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169554047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉把你扔在了原地，然后继续朝灰屋走了"}
{"time": 1766055796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652604084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;爹啊！孩儿不孝啊！孩儿对不住你呀！\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1766055791&#44;\"token\":\"60d39a65e2c8160ab2543ca80fef1fc3\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"爹啊！孩儿不孝啊！孩儿对不住你呀！\"&#44;\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/open.gtimg.cn\\/open\\/app_icon\\/00\\/95\\/17\\/76\\/100951776_100_m.png?t=1765960665\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/qa0m914o2lsi0n44b3j7qiv2ofh94s665feginink24tja1q15l0p7k83tsjr5h26advvoa6np8ftp70d6vkoten8srt3g4qfdsu1cftvl2e0oqesov1t2u6e1q2p3id57m4umd0p4pjds9p88lm2d3br4\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/3f38b9f4c15cc3d88d7e48d01cb9b254\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":1040972910&#44;\"nick\":\"划船不靠桨の233\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/YQpomyL?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY987989FE130EACC8C8E16FA6F7F7D8D9EB3&amp;ts=1766055791228\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1766055935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833745517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……哈，好。就当我格蕾西亚看错了人，我们终究不是一路人”紧咬着牙，抓着刀鞘跑起来，比西姆莉更快，很快就要超过她"}
{"time": 1766056240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839565614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之你们四人互相较劲，很快就全到了灰屋"}
{"time": 1766056263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788988594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卡提西亚没说去哪？）"}
{"time": 1766056269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654613619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(回灰屋啊)"}
