{"time": 1766056293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870213844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刚想说回家）"}
{"time": 1766056297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979537425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "推开二楼的房门，进去找个角落靠着，一声不吭。"}
{"time": 1766056300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074068976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（发现你们的住处也在灰屋）"}
{"time": 1766056351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133052496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1979537425][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 那只骨面斑獸看你好像不开心的样子，靠了过来"}
{"time": 1766056382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725786778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅静静的追上来，站在你另一旁，不知道在想什么"}
{"time": 1766056401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226455303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后西姆莉和格蕾西亚也很快到了那里"}
{"time": 1766056418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668654193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们四个人之间的气氛都怪怪的"}
{"time": 1766056554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737923643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过拉泽拉戈倒不管这些“做的不错，你们几个，很感谢你们帮我完成了三个任务，作为奖励，除了之前约定好的报酬外，等下你们去大男爵的的大宅猩红王冠集合...我会引荐你们和他见面”"}
{"time": 1766056612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739402021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1133052496]伸手摸一摸，这种家伙自己倒是第一次上手"}
{"time": 1766056632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859069640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此前大抵只撸过梅梅"}
{"time": 1766056633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643517891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毛茸茸的，看起来很温顺的样子"}
{"time": 1766056649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564397732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和梅梅的手感倒是完全不同"}
{"time": 1766056737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326767048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（居然很温顺吗）"}
{"time": 1766056749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70366316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们应该算熟人）"}
{"time": 1766056763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115626428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"摇了摇脑袋，拍拍它，心情好了一点点。"}
{"time": 1766056766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655752086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她又不算）"}
{"time": 1766056806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069298956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道还能咬她不成，怎么看都是拉泽拉戈的贵客，还是有点灵性的（））"}
{"time": 1766056856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028186433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅在一旁瞥了瞥嘴，有一种自己生态位被抢走的感觉，抱住了卡提西亚的胳膊摇了摇"}
{"time": 1766056859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102389780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”场内四个人，突然感觉都好陌生。有些乏味，于是只是鼻音很重地嗯了一声“谢谢”"}
{"time": 1766056905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833218220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你们去楼下拿完奖励就过去吧”"}
{"time": 1766057078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179947494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028186433]手从这家伙身上拿开，自己始终还是拿梅梅没什么办法，就算像刚刚那样做了，没被抱着的手拍拍她的脑袋，起身下楼"}
{"time": 1766057084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556253165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一刻也不想在这里停留，先一步下去"}
{"time": 1766057130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870684969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡，刚刚...对不起...我只是不想让你受伤...一点也不想”"}
{"time": 1766057211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308906818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉看到格蕾西亚不理自己了，也没说什么，反而去和卡提西亚走在了一起，总之你们分成了两拨"}
{"time": 1766057218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526508986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "取走了自己的报酬"}
{"time": 1766057282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664514408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那么报酬是多少呢，300？）"}
{"time": 1766057344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094327525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（150）"}
{"time": 1766057439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292166553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...梅梅就这么不信我?\"语气有点黯然，脚步很慢，\"明明...不能用...\""}
{"time": 1766057532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472860523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡连甲都没穿...”"}
{"time": 1766057715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385850458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...只是打一架，说不定...\"皱了皱眉，深深吐了口气，\"都没有问过我...甚至连着我一起。\"越说越有些心里闷得慌"}
{"time": 1766057783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144498628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡自己说的也分生死.. ”"}
{"time": 1766057784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310222550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自己一个人先去猩红王冠前的约定地点等着了"}
{"time": 1766057882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374366620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大家都走的挺快的，没有什么谁先谁后的说法"}
{"time": 1766057930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093782963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要脚底抹油了）"}
{"time": 1766057932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584285543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"事到如今，说那是自己想耍帅说出的话已经不可能了，\"...下次不要再...突然...\"停住嘴，\"唉...算了。\""}
{"time": 1766057950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618056299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尖銳的三角牆和高聳的細長玻璃使大男爵的莊園展露出一種修道院風格，看起來這裡更適合嚴肅學習而不是個休閒歡樂的地方。鹿角帶血的狂野牡鹿圖案反復出現在鐵質屋頂的邊緣和石碶入口上方的紋章上"}
{"time": 1766058024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687611333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "這座莊園在長野鎮東南方的郊外。一對狂野的鑄鐵牡鹿守衛在通往莊園大門的道路兩旁。鑲嵌在鹿角上紅色玻璃閃閃發光，呼應著莊園名稱的來歷。在這對牡鹿之下有兩名陰森的守衛正在站崗"}
{"time": 1766058059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801919670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（敲门（））"}
{"time": 1766058137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494916555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(敲恶魔领主的门?)"}
{"time": 1766058241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988049433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "既然是对方的邀约，想必...这么想着，摇摇头径直走上前"}
{"time": 1766058288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674326276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是等引荐吗）"}
{"time": 1766058310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422569839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该，提前说了?)"}
{"time": 1766058387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621549914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "守卫看到你“我们在此已经等候你们四位多时了，请进吧”"}
{"time": 1766058448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219086890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，辛苦了”低头致意，如果对方不打算带路的话就问问怎么走"}
{"time": 1766058523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37652646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你们看到了一个半身人，穿着管家的服饰对你们行礼“诸位，这边走”"}
{"time": 1766058569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556113294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿出些应有的礼节，\"烦请您带路。\""}
{"time": 1766058578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153812820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "保持几步距离跟在后面"}
{"time": 1766058601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737652478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=38768B3FEC0D149E1DC8164BD630C635.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTYHiEv7otx2Mu_o62JvMw-rE3-MRipsgIg_wooypP3-4jHkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQh2a1SXwyGNPZuApYEYkoMHoCMruCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMElwtvNhal4AdaoMW0nhmVY_ArrA8JpxJTvvlQvC564S9xVk10G0P0tNL6YG_RHfBQ,file_size=39209]"}
{"time": 1766058605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846289483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没绷住）"}
{"time": 1766058650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999554001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔性的大笑呢）"}
{"time": 1766058668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286686019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "跟紧一些"}
{"time": 1766058816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471651372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "莊園的庭院和屋頂的露台都有一些手握十字弓的守衛在巡邏，一些半身人奴隸來來去去的在莊園中穿梭忙碌"}
{"time": 1766058882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225446133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们跟随半身人管家在这偌大的庄园左绕右绕，最后终于到了大男爵的办公室"}
{"time": 1766058926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436461146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大男爵的辦公室用午夜一般漆黑的檀木和猩紅綢緞裝飾。四周牆壁上擺放著高塔一般的書架，面無表情的動物標本和裝有窗簾的壁龕。在房間的盡頭，一個巨大的寫字台和王座一般的高背椅放置在一個巨\r\n大的紋章下方，紋章是一對互鬥的牡鹿，鹿角沾滿了血跡。在寫字台後面，有一扇大窗戶可以俯瞰莊園的庭院。"}
{"time": 1766058972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365192141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "半身人带你们来到这里后，敲了敲门，把门打开后就离开了"}
{"time": 1766058991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330945928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们看到一个头发花白的高瘦男子，站在写字台后"}
{"time": 1766059037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578162660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“请问是男爵大人吗？”躬身致意"}
{"time": 1766059053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306130538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低头行礼，标标准准，\"男爵大人。\""}
{"time": 1766059059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665581316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“這麼說，你們就是拉澤拉戈提到的代理人？我不能說跟我預期的一樣——但是也許在接下來的日子裡也會是一種優勢也說不定。我是達雷勒斯·費克斯，長野鎮的大爵。拉澤拉戈告訴我你們就是報告了本地的女祭司缺乏……愛國主義精神的人。也因為如此，我覺得你們也許是合適的人選，可以幫我結束對長野鎮和法治——也就是我合法統治的威脅。當然，前提是你們能夠經得起考驗。”"}
{"time": 1766059075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048361822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "他抬头扫视了你们一下"}
{"time": 1766059138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955506267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“愿为效劳”"}
{"time": 1766059176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393240144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很荣幸能为您效劳”西姆莉有些激动"}
{"time": 1766059255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557388193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没开口"}
{"time": 1766059502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641293599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，在雇佣你们之前，你们应该还有问题想问吧，但说无妨”"}
{"time": 1766059586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382012457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我确实有些疑惑……或者忧虑。大人的命令颁布后，对命令抱有质疑和抵触情绪的镇民不在少数”依旧低着头"}
{"time": 1766059641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132491468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这有我的考量在，不过既然你问了，告诉你也无妨”"}
{"time": 1766059666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795899962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“此外，餐厅、酒馆的经营标准有些模糊，家庭成员的界定同样如此，有人称镇上有过半人都有血缘关系”"}
{"time": 1766059796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066920990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那位天使骑士，始终藏在暗处，如果不把他处理掉的话，长野就永远处于动荡之中，而我要做的就是引蛇出洞，给他一座充满反叛渴望的城镇”"}
{"time": 1766059840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091069978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "万一镇压不住呢？虽然这么想着，但是没出口"}
{"time": 1766059946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592129464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原来如此……不过，有位医者的担忧尤其令我在意。她担心夜晚有人受伤，而她为了提供治疗，不得不违反宵禁令”这时候才抬起头来"}
{"time": 1766060036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554512221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至于你提的后半部分，旧的治安官已经被我开除了，我也暂时不准备提拔新的，我会让我的守卫去接管长野的安保，但我会给予你们特许权，所以那些问题你们自己处理判断就好，不过虽然这么说，但我希望到时候你们能还给我一个完整的长野”"}
{"time": 1766060058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038490564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也就是便宜行事，解释权在你们手里）"}
{"time": 1766060137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944903433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的，但是感觉这么搞很难不分裂？）"}
{"time": 1766060144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026367858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来我是，锦衣卫）"}
{"time": 1766060181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423737326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上应该恩威并施，但是现在还没到笼络人心的阶段，也轮不到我来提）"}
{"time": 1766060198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589439765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（理论上来说谁反抗你杀谁😡）"}
{"time": 1766060255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48988930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1589439765]（但也没这么夸张）"}
{"time": 1766060282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367086219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(皇权特许)"}
{"time": 1766060299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289276007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2091069978]（实力就是根本啊，你猜这男爵多少级（）"}
{"time": 1766060402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376138712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有什么疑问吗？几位”"}
{"time": 1766060420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436419264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“格蕾西娅明白了。”再次躬身致意“为了切利亚斯”"}
{"time": 1766060458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9110742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡缇希亚和西姆莉呢”"}
{"time": 1766060475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851323174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉摇了摇头“没有了，谢谢大人”"}
{"time": 1766060553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672476252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有。\""}
{"time": 1766060586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226663724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对你随意的态度他也没说什么"}
{"time": 1766060605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540920724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（放下立绘）"}
