{"time": 1766060643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974302391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看着就很像吸血鬼伯爵)"}
{"time": 1766060683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873045626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我去，奇异博士）"}
{"time": 1766060742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597761606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“正如之前所说的，我准备雇佣你们，让你们成为帝国政府的实际代理人，作为回报，每周150金币的报酬，不过不包括你的小宠物，卡缇希亚小姐”"}
{"time": 1766060769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987237580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我有补贴吗？\""}
{"time": 1766060815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559160729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（五险一金？）"}
{"time": 1766060838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436625582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(宠物不花钱吗)"}
{"time": 1766060859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516113780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你玩德鲁伊和召唤师，难道算报酬时候会给你多算嘛）"}
{"time": 1766061038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494644738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然你是对的)"}
{"time": 1766061043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15684496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是不妨碍)"}
{"time": 1766061046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496721907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我问一问)"}
{"time": 1766061158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359516572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事，我马上就来和你三个人分300）"}
{"time": 1766061221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562317981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "他摇摇头“薪水方面就是这样，不过你们表现好的话，会根据业绩加薪，而且我会赐予你们回收战利品的权利，当你们遭受苦难的时候，也可以来找我帮忙解决，对了老治安官的办公室就当做你们暂时的新基地了”"}
{"time": 1766061256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888361394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人话，可以帮忙移除疾病，移除诅咒，还有属性伤害）"}
{"time": 1766061273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401637822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（能复活吗（））"}
{"time": 1766061285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262081537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（应该可以，他等级很高）"}
{"time": 1766061299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731327320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1766061318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344195023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是不会给你们付材料费）"}
{"time": 1766061388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775917482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧，我没有异议。”"}
{"time": 1766061416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408974264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多谢男爵大人关照。”"}
{"time": 1766061462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123766446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“還有另外一件事情要辦。女王阿波羅蓋在這個國家危急時刻發佈了一道敕令，所有的國家代理人都需要通過對宣誓地獄火誓約來重申他們\r\n對其領主、特魯恩家族和切利亞斯的忠誠。如果你們打算在女王的名義下服役，那麼我堅持你們也要進行這一步驟。”"}
{"time": 1766061515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008840385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然，不用担心，这个宣誓只是法律上的效果，不会对心灵有任何影响”"}
{"time": 1766061558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998259747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（本来没怀疑的.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766061592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087567165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本来没怀疑的.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766061707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102143024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“三位有意见吗”他看向你们三个，不包括梅丹佐"}
{"time": 1766061788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188407220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有，既然是女王的决断”心里有些疑虑为什么要强调这一点，但是事已至此，没有拒绝的立场"}
{"time": 1766061840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904554597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉摇了摇头，有些跃跃欲试"}
{"time": 1766061877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821527059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "”男爵大人。“这个时候自己开了口，”您如果对我的背景做过调查，应该知道我的信仰并非魔鬼大公。“紧接着开口，”这份誓约影响我对苍姬的忠诚吗？“"}
{"time": 1766061925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194896105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然不影响，都说了，这只有法律上的效果”"}
{"time": 1766061952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877871213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想到了有两个信仰的虚幻国王）"}
{"time": 1766061965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113034089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和罕见没什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1766062032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572167986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“既然如此，我就没有意见。”点点头"}
{"time": 1766062042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68403830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“雖然有這樣一個名字，但是並不涉及牧師、神祇或是魔鬼，就是走個形式，但由於是女王的命令所以必須遵循。當然，我也已經通過宣誓\r\n重申了自己的忠誠。”"}
{"time": 1766062095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189655517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很好”他点了点头，拉開遮住附近壁龕的窗簾，露出一個金色的支架支撐著的一塊黑色水晶，如同一塊悶燒的巨大地獄餘燼一般，使得整個房間都充滿血腥的顏色。"}
{"time": 1766062151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876366174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“這塊石頭是從弗萊格頌——地獄的第四層——取來的地獄火餘燼。你们必須在宣誓時用手觸摸這塊水晶。當然，會在宣誓時感覺到疼痛，但是並不會持續很久。"}
{"time": 1766062265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631696387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们待会轮流把手放在水晶上宣誓：「我宣誓我絕對忠實於大男爵達雷勒斯·費克斯，來自於『三重詛咒』特魯恩家族的『煉獄女皇』阿波羅蓋二世以及切利亞斯國。」就行了\n”"}
{"time": 1766062318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56038916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”摘下手套。虽然看上去有点吓人，但倒是不太怕痛"}
{"time": 1766062433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197316670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "事已至此，显然也没有回头路了，伸出手按在余烬上"}
{"time": 1766062453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593357352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（轮流，轮流）"}
{"time": 1766062468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219390248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（感觉我就是先登了"}
{"time": 1766062478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458536980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥还没宣完誓呢）"}
{"time": 1766062480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341985020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没意见）"}
{"time": 1766062487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749728984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就当我犹豫了一会）"}
{"time": 1766062514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898084891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=56038916][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 在你之前，卡缇希亚已经把手放了上去，你只能等下一个了"}
{"time": 1766062592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15471913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d6"}
{"time": 1766062592, "type": "reply", "message_id": "15471913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D6=3"}
{"time": 1766062639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598500137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1197316670][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你感觉有些烫，对你造成了一点火焰伤害"}
{"time": 1766062719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037779469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我问你，你的誓言呢）"}
{"time": 1766062758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17890283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，虽然掌心有些灼伤，“我宣誓....我絕對忠實於大男爵達雷勒斯·費克斯，來自於『三重詛咒』特魯恩家族的『煉獄女皇』阿波羅蓋二世以及切利亞斯國。”"}
{"time": 1766062804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705569238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17890283][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 宣誓结束后，你发现手上的烧伤痕迹和切利亚斯标志一样"}
{"time": 1766062905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058454599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，松开手，“这样就好了？”"}
{"time": 1766062958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686826336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没错”大男爵满意的点了点头“下一个吧”"}
{"time": 1766062996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770859579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在卡提西亚松手之后，接着把手按上去，因为灼痛而蹙眉，但清晰地诵道“我宣誓我絕對忠實於大男爵達雷勒斯·費克斯，來自於『三重詛咒』特魯恩家族的『煉獄女皇』阿波羅蓋二世以及切利亞斯國。”"}
{"time": 1766063081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740040753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在你结束之后，西姆莉也上前重复了这个行动"}
