{"time": 1766113669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554828445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们三人宣誓结束后"}
{"time": 1766113679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527404926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "忽然听到了那个熟悉的声音"}
{"time": 1766113706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160629184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拉泽拉戈的声音从房间另一侧响起"}
{"time": 1766113752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212401694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "「我早告訴你他們會宣誓的，」拉澤拉戈說到，「並且渴望工作，至少我這麼覺得。這挺好的，尤其是對於我剛剛發現的事情。&#93;"}
{"time": 1766113781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287460099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大男爵費克斯不耐煩的走到壁龕前拉開簾子說到：「拉澤拉戈，現在已經不再需要什麼戲劇性了。」"}
{"time": 1766113819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45045117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在壁龕中放置著一個凳子和堆滿紙張的寫字\r\n台。上面攀附著一個幾乎要掀翻寫字台的怪物，有著蒼蠅一般的浮腫腹尾，上半身則長出如同人類嬰兒一般的身軀。脖子被蓋在一圈一圈的脂肪褶皱下，一双黑色的复眼在光線下瞇成了一條縫。肥嘟嘟的嘴邊長有昆蟲一般的口器，發出了拉澤拉戈的聲音：「如您所願，大人。」"}
{"time": 1766113855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008801141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，尝试辨认一下这是什么怪物"}
{"time": 1766113883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774708399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=4A3F9E0C38F65A6D265982710238A3F5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ2Cj8WoWNok7FyhNpXlf7sjBphfxiVgQUg_woo2aLu9NbIkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQxv_WrsjwfMtbkO53AFKcH3oCTFCCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMEF1Oobavy2EUrhMuAV8HwQGZcZ_8MDUqfzGr7fFu9HcZwyovj89uKIkSHxjGGPQRA,file_size=82069]"}
{"time": 1766113928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628449554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(wtf)"}
{"time": 1766113933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332466937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么邪恶啊)"}
{"time": 1766113977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007059534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(过什么，位面?)"}
{"time": 1766114000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200767411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……这是”有点被吓到，为了礼仪强行把“什么怪物”四个字咽下，但是不由得后退两步"}
{"time": 1766114010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156072962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大人...您这是”西姆莉也有些吃惊"}
{"time": 1766114069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770783982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拉泽拉戈倒是很坦然“如你们所见，我是一只控斥魔，来自地狱的居民”"}
{"time": 1766114105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453122557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"仔细端详了一番，\"之前算是?考验?\""}
{"time": 1766114196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506739681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没错...之前的每次任务其实我都看在眼里，所以我希望...你们之后不要在内斗了”"}
{"time": 1766114296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206741405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眯起眼，\"我有一个问题，男爵大人，能容许我提问吗？\"微微躬身"}
{"time": 1766114583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460135574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1506739681]“内斗不是我的本意，我只是……”说到一半，却又不想进一步解释“……好吧，我尽量”"}
{"time": 1766114619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764426332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1206741405][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “请”费克斯并没有在意"}
{"time": 1766114777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673403510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=764426332]\"您知道，我和她。\"指着格雷西亚，\"是什么关系吗？\""}
{"time": 1766115036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374860346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”摇摇头，对这个问题的答案并不感兴趣，或者说无论答案是什么都有些害怕。“请允许我先告退了，我还要知会那位医师”"}
{"time": 1766115133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186741266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1374860346]“那可不行”拉泽拉戈叫住了你“我还有情报要告诉你们呢”"}
{"time": 1766115140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338344105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你不能走。\"看着她，语气很低，\"必须弄清楚。\""}
{"time": 1766115161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667191703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1673403510][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 费克斯摇了摇头“我不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1766115169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240389522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有那种法术吗）"}
{"time": 1766115181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700008619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看看两个人之间有没有亲缘？）"}
{"time": 1766115210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287952577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:image,file={E0798DB8-1B85-B4A0-3454-323111F69B3A}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-E0798DB81B85B4A03454323111F69B3A/0,file_size=18006]）"}
{"time": 1766115215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953200490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（万法里的）"}
{"time": 1766115219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287521861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还真tm有）"}
{"time": 1766115224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011322246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还真有啊）"}
{"time": 1766115254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498107048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过，我这里有一张侦测血缘卷轴，如果能帮助你们更好的合作，我不介意对你们用那个”"}
{"time": 1766115344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436311865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦男爵大人了。\"低头垂眸"}
{"time": 1766115436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571272563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们可别抵抗”他强调了一句，尤其是看向格蕾西亚"}
{"time": 1766115476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272991162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后掏出卷轴撕掉，嘴里念念有词..."}
{"time": 1766115520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812331247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不会有什么结果的”有些烦躁“我已经决定好好相处了……”"}
{"time": 1766115618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493623492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过了一会“你们两个人确实有血缘关系...而且很近，是同辈”费克斯说道“还有什么其他疑问吗”"}
{"time": 1766115737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730395294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（第3轮：该区域内目标之间的准确关系。若有一个目标通过意志豁免，则会阻止你判定他与另一个生物的确切关系，只需要有一个目标豁免成功就能阻止你确定他与其他生物的关系。（举个例子，如果有两个兄弟在区域内，一个兄弟意志豁免成功，你就可以看出他们是手足，但不能分辨他们是亲兄弟还是堂兄弟）。）"}
{"time": 1766115763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804554321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很近...\"低头小声喃喃"}
{"time": 1766115785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018770482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...法术显示，你们是亲姐妹”"}
{"time": 1766115845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330676599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么可能，一定是哪里出错了”脱口而出，眼中尽是难以置信“就算长得像……我的家人早就死完了”"}
{"time": 1766115867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920028530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这就是你们自己的事情了”"}
{"time": 1766116133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177715276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...谢谢男爵大人。\"摇摇头，\"还有什么事，请讲吧。\"转向恶魔"}
{"time": 1766116182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058061330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许本该是值得高兴的事，但现在内心完全激不起半点欢欣。神色复杂地看了一眼那张和自己八分像的脸，又固执地别过头去“拉泽拉戈大人，还有什么事，现在就说吧”"}
{"time": 1766117121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650738303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚刚在理发）"}
{"time": 1766117152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66385396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(陌生，怎么就我没理发了)"}
{"time": 1766117414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440287124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“失散多年的姐妹相认，好感动”抹了抹不存在的眼泪“好了，说正事，天使騎士並不像是一個狂熱女祭司捏造的。本鎮一個沒什麼天賦的吟遊詩人萊利·凱爾斯號稱見過她，甚至為她創作了一系列歌謠。雖然這位業餘歌手的歌曲本身就已經是犯罪了，但他昨晚還在破釜沉舟酒館演唱了這些歌曲。\r\n 如果這正好也合大人的意，這些新朋友應當今晚再去酒馆一趟，看看他是否还在那唱，如果仍然有的话，几位可以逮捕破釜沉舟的老闆博爾加特·卡根，為新法令殺雞敬猴。我建議將他鎖在監獄門口的颈手枷上示眾。順便，還可以試試看能不能從凱爾斯口中挖出天使騎士的線索”"}
{"time": 1766117542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459266331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"心情有些说不清道不明，带着些难言的晦涩开口，\"卡提西亚知道了。\""}
{"time": 1766117609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213386504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明白了，今晚我会去解决”心乱如麻，在这里没法整理思绪“……我先回去了”"}
{"time": 1766117718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53683687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(嘻嘻，之前说不想要这样的妹妹，回旋镖来咯)"}
{"time": 1766117800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604951597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们既然有了官方身份...现在可以接管哪些地方?\"甩甩头，问出口"}
{"time": 1766117834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663501677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没人拦着的话，自己就先下楼跑回家了"}
{"time": 1766117848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484816738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭ing）"}
