{"time": 1766118943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183707492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=663501677]西姆莉跟大男爵告别了一下，追上了你"}
{"time": 1766118975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344045009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1729782944]\"这样，既然如此，我明白了。\"呼出口气，\"容我告退，男爵大人。\""}
