{"time": 1766119152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437346291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "先去教堂广场"}
{"time": 1766119204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616109785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等你从猩红王冠，返回到镇子上时，已经黄昏了，此时广场上并没有什么人，不过西姆莉仍然在跟着你"}
{"time": 1766119210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662185506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“来这里做什么”"}
{"time": 1766119261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848420100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=344045009]出门先回灰屋收拾一下自己的床垫，\"梅梅...\"对她伸出手，\"你早就知道?\""}
{"time": 1766119333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573278134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“答应了杰亚，要帮她问问题”抿着嘴低着头“你来干嘛？你不都当我退出了？”"}
{"time": 1766119335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914886833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？知道什么，我只是凭感觉啦”"}
{"time": 1766119350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077395606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1573278134]“那你不是没退出还是来了么”"}
{"time": 1766119432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062933815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我从来没说过要退出”语气淡漠，或者说在刻意淡漠，找诊所的位置"}
{"time": 1766119487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787193816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以你现在怎么想，关于卡缇希亚的事情”"}
{"time": 1766119542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917798349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1914886833]\"算了，你这家伙。\"在床边伸手推倒她，坐在她身上，捏住她的两边脸颊，使劲扯扯，\"谁让你自作主张的?\""}
{"time": 1766119585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206385995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，疼疼疼...我错了小卡”梅梅求饶"}
{"time": 1766119663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133858442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1787193816]“我现在不想想”只是一味地赶路“想也想不出来。之后再说”"}
{"time": 1766119697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026427108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧好吧~_~”"}
{"time": 1766119728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517772922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快你便到了诊所"}
{"time": 1766119764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190258127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=206385995]\"求饶?求饶也不行。\"感觉总不太对，\"变回去——\""}
{"time": 1766119861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082864092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1517772922]找找杰亚"}
{"time": 1766119923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429851104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "杰亚就坐在前台“有事吗，格蕾西亚小姐，马上就要宵禁了..该关门了”"}
{"time": 1766120210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314334684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你让我问的事，我问过了”戴着墨镜，站得笔直“原则上，除了执法人员和得到特许的人，不得违反宵禁令。西亚小姐，你不在特许名单上。”顿了顿“但是如果有特殊需求，可以找我。我会代为联系治安官”"}
{"time": 1766127204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449719929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感谢格蕾西亚小姐告知...但我想问的其实是，我自己当然可以去申请，但假如有人晚上生病了，如何来找我呢”"}
{"time": 1766127378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589589969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1190258127]()"}
{"time": 1766127400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757169328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“事后再找我处理吧，或者。”想了想“你晚上放心不下的话，可以在监狱附近过夜。反正抓到的人都会送过去。”"}
{"time": 1766127453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108051803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1190258127][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯...小卡别捏了..”梅梅乖乖变回了龙的样子"}
{"time": 1766127477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子只能这样了...麻烦格蕾西亚小姐了”"}
{"time": 1766127720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399832332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1108051803]抓住她的肚子一顿揉，自己也倒在床上，脑袋贴在她的脑袋边上小声开口，手上动作不停，\"嗯...如果她和我是亲姐妹...那之前...那个家...?\""}
{"time": 1766127850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503405438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“痒痒...哈哈哈....”梅梅说不出完整的话"}
{"time": 1766127914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227897028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松手，把这家伙抱起来放在自己怀里，\"...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1766127991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663505771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼呼....“松了一口气，安心的趴在你的怀里”小卡的问题...梅梅不知道哦，要不去问小格吧”"}
{"time": 1766128016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987185534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说我没找到说，你的龙可以视为类人的说法啊‘’）"}
{"time": 1766128030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134531674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=770561]稍有些意外于对方真的答应了“这些是出于对西亚小姐名望的尊重……不过家庭集会的规模要限制在三代内的近亲。酒馆餐厅不能同时招待12人以上，让他们尽早考虑发展外卖业务吧。”"}
{"time": 1766128041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180891655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像不叫西亚）"}
