{"time": 1766128499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224862896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663505771]\"不要。\"抱着她，甩甩脑袋，\"我不想问她。\""}
{"time": 1766128635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819919038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=704289125]“嗯”顿了顿，准备离开。走到门口时想起了什么，回头嘱托到“今晚就别去了”"}
{"time": 1766128663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383295193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，以后不许你，自作主张。\"把梅梅举起来，和自己四目相对。"}
{"time": 1766128814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646941697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“格蕾西亚小姐慢走...”"}
{"time": 1766128842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745301048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...以后不会再这样了”伸出小爪子想抱你，但够不到"}
{"time": 1766128949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062643640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦。\"放下她，抱在怀里，\"下不为例...不过...\"下巴蹭蹭她的脑袋，\"没想到那家伙真的是...姐姐?\""}
{"time": 1766128996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943028974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那小卡什么时候和小格再聊聊？”"}
{"time": 1766129056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404686047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（离去破釜沉舟还要多久）"}
{"time": 1766129085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18562233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不聊，才不要。那种家伙，自己说的不要我当妹妹。\""}
{"time": 1766129164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059311136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“差不多该去酒馆了吧...虽说现在差不多已经是宵禁时间了，不过还是过去看一眼吧”"}
{"time": 1766129193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095936042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=18562233]“小卡...好像还有事要做来着..现在已经黄昏了”"}
{"time": 1766129338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033180527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095936042]\"嗯...\"从床上坐起来，\"我知道了嘛。\"把衣服拿起来，\"嗯哼?\""}
{"time": 1766129343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462299319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，我看他们对这法令也没什么遵守的打算。现在去应该一抓一个准”点头，往破釜沉舟走"}
{"time": 1766129349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248577164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来我下午一会有事）"}
