{"time": 1766141966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783248218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（三百多吧）"}
{"time": 1766143503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333238923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1766144339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118713513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "?"}
{"time": 1766144692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225092190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1912897145][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯嗯”"}
{"time": 1766144705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523594583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "巧合的是，你们四人居然在破釜沉舟门口相遇了"}
{"time": 1766145206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004729198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看了一眼卡提西亚，虽然没有逃跑但也只是看了一眼。随后往门里看"}
{"time": 1766149230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753965424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐?\"抬头看她，开口"}
{"time": 1766149508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583573651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "身形有些僵住，一种莫名的麻感从心头传到耳尖，无意识地抖了抖，过了一会才开口“……晚点再说”"}
{"time": 1766149811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144115694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好。\"轻轻应了一声，转头看一眼门内。"}
{"time": 1766149845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128407070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "破釜沉舟酒館的牆壁上裝飾著破舊的盾牌和黯淡的長槍，俯瞰著酒館的吧檯和酒桌。一個小舞台在酒吧的左側地勢略微抬高的部分，使得整個房間都能清晰地看到它。"}
{"time": 1766149893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792578336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "博爾加特·卡根正站在酒吧的盡頭，穿著一條髒兮兮的圍裙，不過這一次他手中並沒有之前的木勺和鍋子。一个看起来是吟游诗人的家伙正坐在舞台上，彈奏一把櫻桃木魯特琴哼唱著一首蹩腳的民謠，他取名為「長野鎮的天使」。"}
{"time": 1766149928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022454614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "周围围绕着许多客人，看起来有十几个，远远超过了法令规定的人数"}
{"time": 1766150061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476553270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "暂且听一听这家伙的吟唱"}
{"time": 1766150162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350186352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1476553270][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 听起来非常的一般且无趣，大致讲了天使降临在长野拯救受压迫的镇民的故事"}
{"time": 1766150184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747508604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不声不响，靠在门外的墙上。现在离日落还没有过太久，索性再等一会，等他们的违规无可争辩"}
{"time": 1766150205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439291545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没过多久吗（））"}
{"time": 1766150212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152117594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（设定其实已经到宵禁的时候了）"}
{"time": 1766150224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278539797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1766150231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277764685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（再等会就没得狡辩了对不对）"}
{"time": 1766150243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483997494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正我们也要听听收集证据）"}
{"time": 1766150243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732288108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1059311136]（）"}
{"time": 1766150265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778253531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打个哈欠，有些性质缺缺，转而听一听听众的议论"}
{"time": 1766150296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227460895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且，杰亚现在理论上是镇民中为数不多的自由人）"}
{"time": 1766150320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277988672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果居民之间有什么密谋，只要跟踪杰亚一个人就能知道的七七八八了）"}
{"time": 1766150345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351223960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟如果有什么需要传话的事，感觉都会找杰亚帮忙啊）"}
{"time": 1766150359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539960953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们在门外，自然没人注意到你们，他们都围在吟游诗人身边，有的在讨论诗歌的内容，有的在担忧违反了法令，有的则表示法不责众，有的则觉得法令只是做做样子"}
{"time": 1766150466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245591928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唱得不错，就是我没太听清，再唱一次如何？”转个身就站到门框中，看着酒馆内的人们"}
{"time": 1766150495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682526414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不急着一起，藏在门外的阴影里"}
{"time": 1766150526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842567619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然你这样说了，但其实只有一些客人注意到了你，他们看到你有些人在偷笑“那家伙白天被卡根泼了一身辣椒酱，结果居然灰溜溜的跑了”"}
{"time": 1766150660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073583735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"注意一下附近有没有窗户，隐匿到一层靠近人群的窗户附近"}
{"time": 1766150672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452755684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，看来你们觉得，男爵大人只是在开玩笑？”缓步走入酒馆“还是说，你们觉得这些这些条例太怀柔了？”"}
{"time": 1766150724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343092355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=52AA46CA9C994DD4249E06D2A0D805D6.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTyKYzPmlPRGWyCURwaKUd1X_JzPBj2yCEg_woopLzlk-DJkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQfHGClLg1V31cjDOc5MkHAXoCCtyCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMEZtfEnz99OOlF-5kDdn3RYRlN2MzwEYkwodw5H5EJWJZmW-XaBZ3Bwq0rUibhzYbg,file_size=550006]（从地图来看的话，似乎没有窗户）"}
{"time": 1766150792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821128928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“非法集会，违反宵禁，煽动叛乱……多好的反面教材”"}
{"time": 1766150795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734610474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "群众有些害怕，不敢做声，吟游诗人有些惊讶，不过卡根低头，甚至没有看你，阴沉的说到“识相的话，就从我的地盘滚开”"}
{"time": 1766150836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597317242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=343092355](好的)"}
{"time": 1766150895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397886409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这儿不再是你的地盘了，卡根。”持刀站定，手持双鹿徽记“以领主的名义，你被捕了。”"}
{"time": 1766150915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922941599", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“胡言乱语，我无法了解”"}
{"time": 1766150922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453242639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“胡言乱语，我无法理解”"}
{"time": 1766150934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705736815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"头号红名诶?\"脸上挂着笑，手里转着匕首，从门外走出来，\"你说，比起在这里做生意，动不动泼执法官辣椒酱，监狱门口的头枷是不是更适合你?\""}
{"time": 1766150972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290964629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是该刷下地图了）"}
{"time": 1766151065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174935583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么执法官，据我所知，现在长野并没有执法官...”他挥了挥手，周围的群众都逃跑了，毕竟他们很害怕暴力波及到自己"}
{"time": 1766151124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516252098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:image,file=AFE517D731EA25F4DEB834D041735C50.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT5fdWb8rl6l5qQHibog9egws12CBi9YSD_CijenLPS4cmRAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhD1mfMTu1Q5k9yPgfUkkjmVegLVjYIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAQSMEZtfEnz99OOlF-5kDdn3RYRlN2MzwEYkwodw5H5EJWJZmW-XaBZ3Bwq0rUibhzYbg,file_size=12477]hh）"}
{"time": 1766151192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859804230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵...\"微微笑了笑，\"那你，先拿你是问吧。\"手持匕首保持警戒向前，\"梅梅。\"轻轻喊一声。(准备护盾术)"}
{"time": 1766151212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177034638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "倒是并不担心他们逃跑，只要认出一两个，稍加威逼利诱，今晚的与会者早晚都能抓住，没必要现在以寡敌众。首要目标只有吟游诗人和卡根“听不懂也没关系，看得懂就行了”"}
{"time": 1766151225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964137148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(token没做，别急"}
